अपि
अ॑पि (prep. w. loc., or ˚— in verbs & nouns) close by or to,<BR>within, before;<BR> adv. further, also, too;<BR> even (w. न = Lat. quidem);<BR>at least, however, but (between words, clauses and sentences, or after,<BR>r. before an emphasized word). Converts an interrog. into an indefinite;<BR>after numerals = all;<BR> at the beginning of a sent. it is a particle of<BR>interrogation, with an optat. it expresses hope, fear, or desire. —<BR>अपि च or चापि further, moreover. अपि—अपि (or च) as well—as.<BR>अपि च — ज चापि rather than. येऽपि—तेऽपि they too—who. यद्यपि<BR>however, although. तथापि even so, nevertheless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=030" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

