अह्
अह् (only pf. आ॑ह) say, speak, tell (w. dat. or acc. of pers.<BR>& acc. of th.), call, name (2 acc.);<BR> state, declare to be (acc.);<BR>attribute or adjudge (acc.) to (gen.). —अधि speak or intercede for<BR>(dat.). अनु recite, repeat. अभि speak to (acc.), answer, reply;<BR>tell (dat. of pers. & acc. of th.). निस् speak out, express. प्र<BR>pronounce, deliver;<BR> say tell, name, declare ( = S.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=056" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

