आ
1 आ॑ adv. hither, near, towards (esp. as a pref. to verbs of<BR>motion);<BR> besides, further;<BR> quite, entirely, even (often only emphasizing<BR>the prec. word). ˚— a little, slightly, scarcely (in adj. & subst.);<BR>reaching to (in adj.);<BR> till, as far as, before, from (in adv.). As prep.<BR>towards, up to, till, as far as (acc. or abl.);<BR> except, but, save<BR>(acc.);<BR> all the way or time from (abl.);<BR> in, at, on (loc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=057" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

