इक्षु|इक्षुः
इक्षु॑ m. sugar-cane;<BR> ˚मती† f. N. of a river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=073" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इक्ष्वाकु|इक्ष्वाकुः
