इङ्ग्|इंग्
इङ्ग् इङ्गति इङ्ग˚ते stir, move (intr.). — C.<BR>इङ्ग॑यति stir, move (tr.);<BR> shake, agitate. उद् & स॑म् C. = S. C.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=073" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इङ्ग|इंग|इङ्गं|इङ्गः
इङ्ग a. movable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=073" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इङ्गन|इंगन|इंगनं
इङ्गन n. shaking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=073" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इङ्गिड
इङ्गिड m. N. of a plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=073" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इङ्गित|इंगित|इङ्गितं
इङ्गित n. gesture, intention.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=073" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इङ्गुद|इंगुद|इंगुदः|इङ्गुदः
इङ्गुद m. ई f. the Iṅguda tree;<BR> n. its nut.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=073" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इच्छा
इच्छा f. wish, desire;<BR> ˚— & instr. according to one's wish,<BR>voluntarily, intentionally.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=073" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इच्छाशक्तिमन्त्|इच्छाशक्तिमत्
इच्छाशक्तिमन्त् a. possessed with the faculty of<BR>desire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=073" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इच्छु|इच्छुः
इच्छु a. desirous of, willing to (acc., inf., or —˚).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=073" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इज्य|इज्यः
इज्य a. to be honoured or worshipped. m. a teacher or a god,<BR>esp. Bṛhaspati, the teacher of the gods. f. आ offering, sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=073" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इट|इटः
इ॑ट m. cane, grass;<BR> also = इटसून॑ n. a mat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=073" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इड्
इ॑ड् f. refreshing draught;<BR> libation;<BR> prayer;<BR> इड॑स्प॑ति m.<BR>lord of libation, E. of gods.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=073" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इड|इडः
इड॑ m. E. of Agni;<BR> N. of a king.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=073" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इडा
इ॑डा f. = इड् + speech, earth, cow;<BR> N. of a goddess<BR>(personif. of worship and sacrifice), a daughter of Manu or Dakṣa, E.<BR>of Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=073" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इळा
इ॑ळा f. = इड् + speech, earth, cow;<BR> N. of a goddess<BR>(personif. of worship and sacrifice), a daughter of Manu or Dakṣa, E.<BR>of Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=073" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इला
इला f. = इड् + speech, earth, cow;<BR> N. of a goddess (personif.<BR>of worship and sacrifice), a daughter of Manu or Dakṣa, E. of Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=073" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इडावन्त्|इडावत्
इ॑डावन्त् a. refreshing or refreshed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=073" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इण्ड्व|इंड्वं
इण्ड्व n. du. the two hand-plates ((r.)).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=073" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इत|इतः
इत॑ n. going, way.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=073" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इतर|इतरः
इ॑तर (n. ˚रम् or ˚रद्) a. other, different from (abl.<BR>or —˚);<BR> usual, common. इतरैतर the one — the other. Obs. also<BR>द्विजेतर not a Brahman;<BR> सुखेतर n. pl. joy and woe;<BR> दक्षिणेतर<BR>left.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=073" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इतरतस्
इतर॑तस् adv. otherwise, elsewhere.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=073" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इतरत्र
इतरत्र adv. the same, also = loc. of इतर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=073" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इतरथा
इतर॑था adv. otherwise, else.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=073" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इतरेतर|इतरेतरं
