इतस्
इत॑स् adv. hence, from here (also इत ऊर्ध्वम्);<BR> from this<BR>time, from now, henceforward (also इतो॑ ऽपरम्, इतः परम्, and इतः॑<BR>प्रभृति);<BR> here, hither. इतैतः hither, hither! इतः — इतः here<BR>— there;<BR> इतस्ततः here and there, hither and thither, to and fro.<BR>इतः॑ पू॑र्वम् formerly. — Also = abl. or loc. of 1 इ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इति|इतिः
1 इ॑ति adv. thus, so. It refers to something said or thought,<BR>which it follows (rarely precedes), and is often = with these words,<BR>here endeth (cf. अथ), at this thought, as you know etc.;<BR> often not<BR>to be transl. at all. A nom. before इति may have the mg. of an acc.<BR>इतीति, इतीव, इत्युत, इत्येव, इत्येवम्, इति ह स्म & इति स्म ह = इति<BR>alone. इति तावत् as much as, the same as (—˚). इति कृत्वा for this<BR>reason. किमिति wherefore, why? or = इति किम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इति|इतिः
2 इ॑ति इति॑ f. going, pursuing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इति|इतिः
इति॑ f. going, pursuing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इतिकर्तव्य|इतिकर्त्तव्य
इतिकर्तव्य a. fit or proper to be done, necessary;<BR>abstr. ˚कर्तव्यता etc. necessity, obligation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इतिकार्य
इति˚कार्य a. fit or proper to be done, necessary;<BR>abstr. ˚कर्तव्यता etc. necessity, obligation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इतिकृत्य
