इतिवत्
इतिवत् adv. just so.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इतिवृत्त
इतिवृत्त n. occurrence, event.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इतिहास|इतिहासः
इतिहास॑ m. story, legend, tradition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इतोगत
इतोगत a. relating to this (lit. gone hither).*<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इतोमुख
