इत्थम्
इत्थ॑म् adv. thus, in this way.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इत्थंभूत|इत्थम्भूत
इत्थंभूत a. being thus, so qualified, of this kind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इत्था
इत्था॑ adv. = इत्थ॑म् + right, well, really, truly,<BR>indeed, even;<BR> o. only emphasizing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इत्यर्थम्
इत्यर्थम् adv. for this purpose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इत्या
इत्या॑ f. course, way.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इत्यादि
इत्यादि adj. beginning thus;<BR> n. — and so on.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इत्येवमादि
इत्येवमादि adj. beginning thus;<BR> n. — and so on.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इत्वन्
इत्वन् a. (only —˚) going, moving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इत्वर|इत्वरः
इत्वर॑ a. the same;<BR> low mean.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इद्
इ॑द् (indecl., orig. n. of 1. इ) just, exactly, even (lays<BR>stress on the prec. word).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इदंरूप
इदं॑रूप^1 a. thus shaped.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20160412. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/CORRECTIONS/issues/275.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इदम्
इद॑म् (n. sgl. & ˚— as stem) this, this here (refers to<BR>something following, rarely preceding);<BR> this all or this universe<BR>(±वि॑श्वम्, स॑र्वम्, or सकलम्). Obs. also तदिदम् even this, this<BR>very thing, किमिदम् what here? As adv. here;<BR> now, thus, even, right.<BR>इद॑मिदम् here and there, now and then.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इदा
इदा॑ adv. now, this moment;<BR> w. अह्नस् this very day;<BR> w.<BR>ह्यस् only yesterday.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इदानीम्
इदा॑नीम् adv. = prec. (also w. अह्नस्);<BR> इदानीमेव<BR>immediately, just;<BR> इदानीमपि even now, still.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इध्
इध् इन्ध्, इन्द्धे॑ pp. इद्ध॑ kindle, set on fire,<BR>inflame;<BR> P. इध्य॑ते be lighted, flame. अनु kindle. अभि surround<BR>with flames, set on fire. आ kindle, burn (tr. & intr.). परि kindle<BR>on all sides. सम् kindle, burn (tr. & intr.);<BR> inflame, rouse,<BR>strengthen. — Cf. प्रे॑द्ध.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इध्म|इध्मं|इध्मः
इध्म॑ (& इध्मन्) m. fuel, esp. for the sacred fire, p.<BR>˚वन्त्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन|इनः
इन॑ a. strong, mighty, fierce;<BR> m. a great lord or king, the<BR>sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इनक्ष्
इनक्ष् इ॑नक्षति strive to get. - उद् & सम् the same.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्दीवर|इंदीवर|इंदीवरं|इन्दीवरं
