इन्दु|इंदुः|इन्दुः
इ॑न्दु m. a drop, esp. of Soma;<BR> the drop or spark in the sky,<BR>i.e. the moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्दुबिम्ब
इन्दुबिम्ब n. the orb of the moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्दुमुख
इन्दुमुख (f. ई) & ˚वदन a. moon-faced.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्दुशेखर|इन्दुशेखरः
इन्दुशेखर m. E. of Śiva (lit. moon-crested).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्द्र|इंद्रः|इन्द्रः
इ॑न्द्र m. N. of the national god of the Indo-Aryans;<BR> later<BR>also chief, first, the best of one's kind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्द्रगोप|इन्द्रगोपः
1 इ॑न्द्रगोप & ˚पा a. having Indra as guard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्द्रगोप|इन्द्रगोपः
2 इन्द्रगोप॑ & ˚गोपक m. the cochineal insect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्द्रचाप
इन्द्रचाप m. Indra's bow, i.e. the rain-bow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्द्रजाल|इन्द्रजालं
इन्द्रजाल^1꣡ n. Indra's net;<BR> a cert. mystic weapon;<BR>juggling, magic.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20160412. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/CORRECTIONS/issues/275.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

