इन्द्रजालिन्
इन्द्र˚जालिन् m. juggler, prestigiator.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

