इन्द्रजूत
इ॑न्द्रजूत a. sped by Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=075" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्द्रज्येष्ठ
