इन्द्रेषित
इ॑न्द्रेषित a. sent or impelled by Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=075" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्ध|इंध|इन्धः
इ॑न्ध a. kindling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=075" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्धन|इंधन|इन्धनं
इन्धन n. kindling, lighting;<BR> fuel, wood, p. ˚वन्त्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=075" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्धन्वन्
इ॑न्धन्वन् a. flaming.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=075" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्व्
इन्व् (इनु, इन्), इ॑न्वति, इनो॑ति send forth, press on, set<BR>in motion, give out, utter;<BR> further, favour;<BR> possess, dispose of (acc.);<BR>force, overwhelm, remove, destroy. — अव send down. आ send hither,<BR>procure. प्र stir up, raise. प्रति further, speed. वि push off,<BR>remove;<BR> send forth, spend. सम् impart, restore. — Cf. उपेनित.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=075" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इभ|इभः
इ॑भ m. n. household, family;<BR> m. elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=075" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इभदन्ता
*इभदन्ता f. N. of a plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=075" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इभ्य|इभ्यः
इ॑भ्य a. belonging to one's household;<BR> m. vassal, rich man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=075" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इम्
इ॑म् interj.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=075" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इम
इम॑ (pron. stem in some obl. cases) this.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=075" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इमथा
इम॑था adv. in this manner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=075" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इयक्ष्
