इयक्षु
इयक्षु॑ a. longing, eager.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=075" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इयच्चिरम्
इयच्चिरम् adv. so long, till now.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=075" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इयत्तक
इयत्तक॑ (f. ˚त्तिका॑) so small, so little.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=075" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इयत्ता
इयत्ता f. quantity, number, measure, distance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=075" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इयन्त्|इयत्
