इयम्
इय॑म् f. this (here), this earth (±पृथिवी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=075" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इयसा
इयसा॑ f. shrinking, lassitude.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=075" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इयस्य्
इयस्य् इय˚स्यते shrink, relax, dwindle;<BR> pp. इयसित॑,<BR>as n. = इयसा॑.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=075" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इरज्य्
