इरध्
इरध् इर˚धते strive to gain;<BR> dat. inf. इर॑ध्यै.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=075" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इरस्य्
इरस्य् इर˚स्य॑ति be angry or envious (w. dat.). —<BR>अभि the same.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=075" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इरस्या
इरस्या॑ f. ill-will, anger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=075" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इरा
इ॑रा f. drink, refreshing draught;<BR> comfort, enjoyment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=075" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इरा
इरा॑ f. drink, refreshing draught;<BR> comfort, enjoyment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=075" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इरावन्त्|इरावत्
इ॑रावन्त् a. giving refreshment, gladdening;<BR> ˚वती† f. N.<BR>of a river and sev. mythol. women.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इरिण|इरिणं|इरिणः
इरिण n. water-course, rivulet;<BR> a hollow or hole, desert<BR>land;<BR> gaming board.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इरिणस्थ
इ॑रिणस्थ a. standing on barren soil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इरिन्
इ॑रिन् a. strong, mighty;<BR> m. a despot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इर्य|इर्य्य
इ॑र्य a. active, vigorous, powerful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इल्
इल् (इलति come), इल॑यति be quiet, not budge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इलव|इलवः
इलव m. ploughman, peasant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इव
इव (encl.) like, as, as it were, so to speak, almost, nearly,<BR>about;<BR> just, quite, even (o. only explet.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्
1 इ॑ष् इषति एषति (—˚), इ॑ष्यति, इष्णा॑ति (also M.), pp.<BR>इपित॑ send, impel, hurl, throw, raise (the voice), utter, proclaim;<BR>incite, promote, further;<BR> intr. advance, strive;<BR> tend towards, aim at<BR>(dat. or loc.). — अनु follow, seek, look for (acc.). प्र A. & M.<BR>drive forth, send out;<BR> call upon, summon, invite. C. प्रेषयति, ˚ते<BR>hurl, cast, send out, dismiss. अनुप्र C. send forth after. संप्र<BR>summon, invite;<BR> send forth, dismiss.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्
2 इष् इच्छ॑ति इच्छ॑˚ते pp. इष्ट॑ (q.v.) seek, desire,<BR>like, choose;<BR> acknowledge, state, take for (2 acc.);<BR> wish that (acc. &<BR>inf. or 2acc.);<BR> ask a thing (acc.) of some one (abl. or loc.);<BR> intend,<BR>be about or going to (inf.);<BR> w. न disagree, decline, refuse to<BR>(inf.), object to (acc.). P. इष्यते be liked, wanted, approved,<BR>recognised;<BR> pass for (nom.). — अनु seek, search, try., strive after,<BR>wish for. C. अन्वेषयति seek, wait for (acc.). पर्यनु seek about.<BR>समनु search. अभि seek for, strive after, exert one's self at<BR>(acc.);<BR> intend to (inf.). परि look about for (acc.). प्रति strive<BR>towards, seek after (acc.), receive, accept from (gen.);<BR> attend to,<BR>observe. वि seek. — Cf. अभी॑ष्ट.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्
3 इ॑ष् f. drink, refreshment, vigour, strength;<BR> w. ऊ॑र्ज् drink<BR>and food.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष|इषः
1 †इष (—˚) a. seeking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष|इषः
2 इष॑ a. vigorous, strong, fat, juicy, fruitful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इषणय्
इषणय् इषण˚यते & इषण्य् इष˚ण्यति impel, stir up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इषण्या
इषण्या॑ f. stir, impulse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इषय्
