इषयु
इषयु॑ a. fresh, vigorous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इषवन्त्|इषवत्
इष॑वन्त् a. fresh, vigorous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इषि
इषि॑ f. refreshing (dat. as inf.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इषिध्
इषि॑ध् f. offering, gift.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इषिर|इषिरः
इषिर॑ a. refreshing, enlivening;<BR> fresh, strong, quick.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इषीका
इषी॑का f. reed, stem of grass, arrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इषु|इषुः
इ॑षु m. f. arrow;<BR> poss. इ॑षुमन्त् (इषुम॑न्त्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इषुधि|इषुधिः
