इषुध्य्
इषुध्य् इषु˚ध्य॑नि implore (acc.);<BR> beg for (dat.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

