इष्कृत
इ॑ष्कृत a. arranged, prepared.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्कृति|इष्कृतिः
इ॑ष्कृति f. arrangement, putting right.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्ट|इष्टं|इष्टः
1 इष्ट॑ a. sought, wished for, desired, liked, pleasant, dear;<BR>auspicious, happy;<BR> approved, settled, valid. m. favourite, lover,<BR>husband;<BR> n. wish, desire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्ट|इष्टं|इष्टः
2 इष्ट॑ a. sacrificed;<BR> m. n. sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्टका
इ॑ष्टका f. brick.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्टकामदुह्
इष्टकामदुह् f. (nom. धुक्) the fabulous wonder cow^1<BR>granting (all) desires.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by AnnaRybakovaT, Jim Funderburk. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

