इष्टसाधन a. fulfilling one's wish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्टापूर्त|इष्टापूर्तं|इष्टापूर्त्त|इष्टापूर्त्तं
इष्टापूर्त॑ n. sg. & du. & इष्टापूर्ति f. sacrifice and<BR>charity;<BR> poss. ˚र्ति॑न्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्टि|इष्टिः
1 इष्टि॑ f. impulse, furtherance, aid (abstr. & concr.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्टि|इष्टिः
2 इष्टि॑ f. seeking, request, wish, desire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्टि|इष्टिः
3 इ॑ष्टि f. sacrifice (mostly of a simpler kind).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्मिन्
इष्मि॑न् a. impetuous, rash.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्वसन
इष्वसन n. a bow (arrow-thrower).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्वस्त्र
इष्वस्त्र n. a bow (arrow-thrower).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्वस्त्रकर्मन्
इष्वस्त्रकर्मन् n. the practice of archery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्वास|इष्वासं|इष्वासः
इष्वास॑ m. archer or bow (lit. = इष्वसन).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इस्
इ॑स् ( = निस्) v. 1 कृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इह
इह॑ adv. here, hither;<BR> here in this world, in<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=77" target="_blank">Page77</a>]<BR>this<BR>case, in this system or book, etc.;<BR> now, this moment. Also = loc. of<BR>1 अ. — इहे॑ह here and there, hence and thence, now and then.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इहलोक|इहलोकः
इहलोक m. the world here (below).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=077" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इहस्थ
इहस्थ a. standing or staying here.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=077" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इहार्थ
इहार्थ a. useful here (for this world).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=077" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इहार्थिन्
इहार्थिन् a. busy here (for this world).<BR>!!<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=077" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईक्ष्
ईक्ष् ई॑क्षते (ई॑क्ष˚ति), pp. ईक्षित॑ (q.v.) look, view,<BR>behold, perceive, see (l.&f.), consider, regard, expect;<BR> *tell fortune<BR>to (dat.). C. ईक्षयति cause to look at (acc.). — अप look away,<BR>look off to, watch, regard, consider, wait for, expect, require. अभि<BR>look at (acc.). अव look at, view, consider, regard, expect, hope.<BR>अन्वव regard, consider. प्रत्यव look at, inspect, examine.<BR>समव view, regard, consider. उद् look up to, gaze at (acc.), wait,<BR>expect. समुद् look up to, gaze at, behold, perceive;<BR> think of,<BR>consider (acc.). उप look on, behold, observe;<BR> overlook, neglect.<BR>समुप the same. निस् look at, perceive, contemplate. परि look<BR>round, investigate, scrutinize, examine. प्र look at, behold,<BR>perceive;<BR> overlook, neglect. अभिप्र view, regard. उत्प्र look up to<BR>(acc.), regard as (2 acc.), suppose, imagine;<BR> transfer, use or call<BR>metaphorically ((rh.)). उपप्र A. disregard, overlook. अभिसंप्र look<BR>at (acc.). प्रति look towards. behold, observe;<BR> wait, expect;<BR> bear<BR>with, tolerate (acc.). संप्रति wait, expect. वि regard, behold,<BR>deliberate, ponder, consider as (वत्);<BR> inquire, perceive, discern.<BR>अनुवि look about, behold;<BR> examine, try. अभिवि & समभिवि regard,<BR>behold, perceive, observe. उद्वि look (up) to, perceive, observe,<BR>investigate. सम् look upon, behold, observe, consider;<BR> think of, aim<BR>at (acc.);<BR> try, examine, find out, ascertain. अभिसम् & प्रसम्<BR>behold, regard, consider.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=077" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईक्ष
ईक्ष f. ई looking, seeing (—˚);<BR> f. आ view,<BR>consideration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=077" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईक्षक|ईक्षकः
ई॑क्षक m. spectator, beholder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=077" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईक्षण|ईक्षणं
ईक्षण n. look, view, aspect, eye;<BR> looking after, caring<BR>for (gen.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=077" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

