ईक्षणपथ m. path of the eyes, horizon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=077" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईक्षणिक|ईक्षणिकः
ईक्षणिक m. seer, soothsayer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=077" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईक्षणीक
ईक्ष˚णीक m. seer, soothsayer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=077" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईक्षित
ईक्षित॑ a. seen, beheld;<BR> n. view, aspect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=077" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईक्षितृ
ईक्षितृ a. seeing, a beholder of (gen.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=077" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईक्षेण्य
ईक्षे॑ण्य a. worth seeing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=077" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईङ्ख्|ईंख्
ईङ्ख्^1 ईङ्खति C. ईङ्ख॑यति swing, shake. — प्र<BR>tremble, shake. C. swing (tr.);<BR> M. swing (intr.).<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20160419. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/CORRECTIONS/issues/290. note: DAtu, missing virAma..<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=077" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईङ्खन
ईङ्खन n. swinging.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=077" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

