ईड्
1 ईड् ई॑ट्टे pp. ईळित॑ praise, implore, beg for (acc.,<BR>gen., or dat.). — प्र, उपप्र, प्रति, सम् & प्रसम् praise, honour,<BR>worship.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=077" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

