ईळेण्य
ईळे॑ण्य a. to be asked for (dat.);<BR> also = seq.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=077" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईड्य
