उ|उः
2 उ (encl.) and, also, yet, now, soon, again;<BR> lays stress on a<BR>prec. pron., particle or infin. in तवै (तवा उ);<BR> उ षु ( = सु)<BR>right soon, मो ( = माउ) षु never. उ-उ (or उत) on the one<BR>hand-on the other hand, as well-as.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=079" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊ
