ऋक्षवन्त्|ऋक्षवत्
ऋक्षवन्त् m. N. of a mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=096" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्षीका
