ऋग्मिन्
ऋग्मि॑न् a. praising.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=096" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋग्मिय
ऋग्मि॑य a. deserving praise, laudable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=096" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋग्मिय
ऋ॑ग्मिय a. deserving praise, laudable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=096" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋग्यजुष्
