ऋग्विधान
ऋग्विधान n. the application of the Ric, N. of a book.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=096" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋग्वेद|ऋग्वेदः
