ऋघाय्
ऋघाय् ऋघा॑यति ऋघा॑य˚ते tremble, rage, rave.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=096" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋघावन्
ऋ॑घावन् a. raving, storming, impetuous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=096" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋघावन्त्|ऋघावत्
ऋ॑घा˚वन्त् a. raving, storming, impetuous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=096" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋच्
1 ऋच् अ॑र्चति beam, shine, sing, praise, honour, adorn. C.<BR>अर्चयति, ˚ते, pp. अर्चित (q.v.) cause to shine;<BR> honour, salute.<BR>—अभि sing, praise, honour. प्र shine forth, intone, sing, honour.<BR>सम् honour, worship, adorn. — Cf. ऋच॑से.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋच्
2 ऋ॑च् f. lustre, beam;<BR> hymn, verse;<BR> the Rigveda (mostly pl.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋचसे
ऋच॑से (dat. inf.) to praise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋचीक|ऋचीकः
ऋचीक m. N. of a man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋचीषम
ऋ॑चीषम a. E. of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋज्
1 ऋज् ऋञ्ज॑ति ऋञ्ज॑˚ते ऋ॑ज्यति ऋ॑ज्य˚ते stretch out<BR>(intr.), strive after, long for. — अभि grasp, snatch. आ M. strive<BR>after, long for. नि reach, attain. प्र strive towards. सम् strive<BR>together. — Cf. इरज्य्, ˚य॑ति & ऋञ्जसान॑.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋज्
2 ऋज् अ॑र्जति reach, get, obtain. C. अर्जयति, अर्जय˚ते =<BR>S. — अति get over, admit or remove. अनु & अव dismiss. उप admit;<BR>C. get, acquire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजिप्य
ऋजिप्य॑ a. striving onwards, hastening.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजीक|ऋजीकः
†ऋजीक a. beaming, shining (only —˚).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजीति|ऋजीतिः
ऋ॑जीति a. burning, sparkling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजीयंस्
ऋ॑जीयंस् compar. to ऋजु॑.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजीष|ऋजीषं
ऋजीष॑ a. = seq., m. a cert. hell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजीषिन्
ऋजीषि॑न् a. hastening, advancing, swift.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजु
ऋजु॑ (f. ऋज्वी) straight, right, upright, honest^1;<BR> n. adv.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by AnnaRybakovaT, Jim Funderburk. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजुता
ऋजुता f. straightness;<BR> also = seq.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजुत्व|ऋजुत्वं
ऋजुत्व n. sincerity, honesty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजूय्
ऋजूय् only ऋजूय॑न्त् honest & ऋजूय॑मान upright.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजूया
ऋजूया॑ (instr. adv.) straightways, directly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजूयु
ऋजूयु॑ a. honest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋज्र|ऋज्रः
ऋज्र॑ a. reddish brown, dark red.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋञ्जसान|ऋंजसान|ऋञ्जसानः
ऋञ्जसान॑ a. rushing on, hastening near, striving to<BR>(acc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋण|ऋणं
ऋण॑ a. guilty;<BR> n. guilt, debt, obligation. ऋणं कृ borrow<BR>of (gen.), ˚धारय् be indebted to (gen.), ˚दा, नी, or संनी pay a<BR>debt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋणकर्तृ|ऋणकर्त्तृ
