ऋणयात्
ऋण˚या॑त् a. prosecuting or punishing guilt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋणयावन्
