ऋणवन्
ऋणव॑न् a. guilty, indebted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋणवन्त्|ऋणवत्
ऋण˚वन्त् a. guilty, indebted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋणादान|ऋणादानं
ऋणादान n. non-payment of a debt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋणावन्
