ऋणिन्
ऋणिन् a. indebted, obliged;<BR> m. a debtor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋत|ऋतं|ऋतः
ऋत॑ a. right, true, honest, fit, proper. n. & instr. ऋते॑ण<BR>adv.;<BR> n. as subst. right way. established order, divine law, pious work;<BR>righteousness, faith, truth, oath.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतजा
ऋतजा॑ a. right or righteous by nature.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतजात
ऋत॑जात a. right or righteous by nature.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतज्ञा
ऋतज्ञा॑ a. knowing the sacred law.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतद्युम्न
†ऋतद्युम्न a. full of sacred strength.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतधीति
ऋत॑धीति a. right or true-minded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतनी
ऋतनी॑ a. leading the right way.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतपा
ऋतपा॑ a. observing righteousness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतप्रजात
ऋत॑प्रजात a. = ऋतजा॑.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतप्सु|ऋतप्सुः
†ऋतप्सु a. of right or good appearance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतय्
ऋतय् ऋत˚यते (pp. ऋतय॑न्त् or ऋत॑यन्त्) make right.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतया
ऋतया॑ (instr. adv.) in the right way.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतयु
ऋतयु॑ a. observing the divine law, pious, holy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतयुज्
ऋतयु॑ज् a. well harnessed or well allied.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतवाक|ऋतवाकः
ऋतवाक॑ m. right or pious speech.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतसद्
ऋतस॑द् a. dwelling in truth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतसाप्
ऋतसा॑प् a. practising righteousness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतस्पृश्
ऋतस्पृ॑श् a. loving (lit. touching) righteous ness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋताय्
ऋताय् pp. ˚य॑न्त्र lead or make right, observe the law;<BR> be<BR>obedient, pious, or honest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतावन्
ऋता॑वन् f. ˚वरी lawful, righteous, just, pious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतावृध्
ऋतावृ॑ध् a. rejoicing in the divine law, holy-minded^1,<BR>faithful.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by AnnaRybakovaT, Jim Funderburk. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतामृत
ऋतामृत n. du. truth and nectar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋति|ऋतिः
ऋति॑ f. onset, struggle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋति|ऋतिः
ऋ॑ति f. onset, struggle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतीय्
ऋतीय् ऋती˚य॑ते struggle, quarrel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतीषह्
ऋतीष॑ह् a. enduring or defying assault;<BR> durable, lasting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतीषाह्
(ऋती˚षा॑ह्) a. enduring or defying assault;<BR> durable,<BR>lasting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतु|ऋतुः
ऋतु॑ m. right or fixed time, period, epoch, season (mostly<BR>reckoned as 6, but also 5, 7, 12, & 24);<BR> the menses of a woman & coition<BR>at that time;<BR> fixed order, rule. — ऋतु॑ना & ऋतु॑भिस् in time, at the<BR>appointed time, esp. for sacrifice or a festival: पुर॑ ऋतो॑स् before<BR>the (right) time, too early.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतुकाल|ऋतुकालः
ऋतुकाल m. the time of the season or the time of<BR>menstruation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=098" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतुथा
ऋतुथा॑ adv. in order, duly, exactly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=098" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

