एजय
†एजय a. stirring, rousing (only —˚).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=101" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एज्य
