एड|एडः
एड m. a kind of sheep.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=101" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एडक|एडकः
एडक m. a kind of sheep.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=101" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एण|एणः
एण m. एणी॑ f. a kind of black antelope.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=101" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

