एणाक्षी
एणाक्षी f. deer-eyed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=101" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एणीदृश्
एणीदृश् f. deer-eyed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=101" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एत|एतं|एतः
1 एत॑ pron. stem, nom. sgl. एष॑, एषा॑, एत॑द् (q.v.) this,<BR>this here;<BR> refers oftener to the preceding than the following;<BR> may be<BR>connected with another demonstr., rel. or interr. pron. — Loc.<BR>एतस्मिन् in this case.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=101" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एत|एतं|एतः
2 ए॑त f. ए॑नी rushing, quick;<BR> m. a deer;<BR> f. एता a doe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=101" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एत|एतं|एतः
3 ए॑त a. arrived, come.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=101" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतग्व|एतग्वः
ए॑तग्व a. going quickly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=101" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतत्काल|एतत्कालः
