एतत्तुल्य
एतत्तुल्य a. like this.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=101" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतद्
एत॑द् (n. sgl. of एत॑) adv. thus, in this manner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=101" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतदन्त
एतदन्त a. ending with this or these.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=101" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतदर्थम्
एतदर्थम् adv. for this purpose, therefore.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=101" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतदवस्थ
एतदवस्थ a. being in this condition, thus situated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=101" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतद्योनि
एतद्योनि a. having this origin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=101" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतद्वश
एतद्वश a. depending on this.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=101" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतद्विद्
एतद्विद् a. knowing this.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=101" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतन्नामक
एतन्नामक a. having this name.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=101" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतन्निमित्तम्
एतन्निमित्तम् adv. for this reason.*<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=101" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतन्मय
एतन्म॑य f. ई consisting of this, of such a kind or<BR>nature.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=101" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतर्हि
एत॑र्हि adv. now, at present, at this time (often correl.<BR>to य॑र्हि).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=101" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतवे
ए॑तवे dat. inf. to 2 इ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=101" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतवै
ए॑तवै॑ dat. inf. to 2 इ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=101" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतश|एतशः
ए॑तश a. swift, quick;<BR> m. a horse, esp. of the Sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=101" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतश|एतशः
एतश॑ a. swift, quick;<BR> m. a horse, esp. of the Sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=101" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतादृक्ष
एतादृ॑क्ष (f. ई) such, of this or the same kind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतादृश्
एता˚दृ॑श् (f. ई) such, of this or the same kind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतादृश
एता˚दृश (f. ई) such, of this or the same kind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतावन्त्|एतावत्
