एतृ
एतृ॑ a. going (—˚).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एद्
ए॑द् ( = आ+इद्) behold! (w. acc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एध्
