एरक
एरक m. N. of a serpent-demon;<BR> f. आ a kind of grass, ई<BR>N. of a plant & a river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एरण्ड|एरंडः|एरण्डः
