एला
एला f. cardamoms.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एव|एवं|एवः
1 एव॑ adv. so, even so;<BR> certainly, really;<BR> even, just,<BR>exactly, emphasizing the prec. word or only expl., often connected with<BR>a pron. or another adv., e.g. स एव, एतदेव, इत्येव, तथैव, नैव,<BR>चैव;<BR> एव च, एव वा, etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एवा
एवा॑ adv. so, even so;<BR> certainly, really;<BR> even, just,<BR>exactly, emphasizing the prec. word or only expl., often connected with<BR>a pron. or another adv., e.g. स एव, एतदेव, इत्येव, तथैव, नैव,<BR>चैव;<BR> एव च, एव वा, etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एव|एवं|एवः
