एवंप्रकार
एवंप्रकार a. of such kind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एवंप्राय
एवंप्राय a. the same.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एवंभूत|एवम्भूत
एवंभूत a. (being) such.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एवया
