कतिधा
कतिधा॑ (adv. interr.) in how many places or parts? how<BR>often? w. चिद् everywhere.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=107" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कतिपय|कतिपयः
कतिपय॑ f. ई (आ) some, several. *Instr. & abl. n.<BR>adv. with some exertion, hardly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=107" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कतिपयकुसुम
कतिपयकुसुम a. having few flowers or blossoms.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=107" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

