कतिपयरात्रम् (acc. adv.) some days (lit. nights).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=107" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कतिपयाहस्य
कतिपयाहस्य (gen. adv.) after some days.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=107" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कतिविध
कतिविध a. how manifold?<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=107" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कत्ता
कत्ता f. a die.*<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=107" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

