कत्थन a. & n. boasting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=107" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कथंरूप
कथंरूप a. of what shape?<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=107" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कथंवीर्य
कथंवीर्य a. of what power?<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=107" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कथक|कथकः
कथक a. relating;<BR> m. relater, reciter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=107" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

