कथंजातीयक a. of what kind?<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=107" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कथन|कथनं
कथन a. telling, tale, story.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=107" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कथनीय
कथनीय a. to be told or named.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=107" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कथम्
कथ॑म् adv. how? in what way? whence? interr. & excl.;<BR>often followed by नु ( = कथम् alone or = how much more, w. neg. how<BR>much less);<BR> also by इव, नाम, स्विद्. With चन, चिद्, & (later) अपि<BR>indef. somehow, in any way, scarcely, hardly, a little (कथम्<BR>sometimes doubled);<BR> w. a negation (कथं चन also alone) in no way,<BR>by no means, not at all. यथा कथं चिद् howsoever, anyhow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=107" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कथंभूत
कथंभूत a. how being? of what quality?<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=107" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कथय्
कथय् कथ˚यति (कथ˚यते) pp. कथित (q.v.)<BR>talk, converse with (instr. ± सह);<BR> relate, report, denounce,<BR>declare, explain, state. P. be called, pass for (nom.). — परि name.<BR>प्र announce, report. वि talk idly, chatter. सम् = S.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=107" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कथयितव्य
कथयितव्य a. to be told or mentioned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=107" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कथा
1 कथा॑ adv. how? in what way? whence? In a. l. more<BR>frequent than कथ॑म् q.v. — य॑था कथा॑ च howsoever.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=107" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कथा
2 कथा f. talk, conversation about (loc. or —˚);<BR> tale,<BR>story of (gen. or —˚);<BR> communication, mention, statement;<BR> discussion,<BR>dialogue. — का कथा what mention of i.e. to say nothing of (gen.,<BR>loc., or प्रति w. acc.). कैषा कथा to say nothing of it. कथां<BR>कृ talk or think of (gen.).*<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=107" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

