कथानक n. a short tale or story.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=107" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कथान्तर|कथांतर
कथान्तर n. (course of) conversation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=108" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कथावली
कथावली f. collection of tales.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=108" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कथासरित्सागर
कथासरित्सागर m. ocean of the rivers of tales,<BR>T. of a work of Somadeva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=108" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कथित|कथितः
कथित a. said, mentioned;<BR> n. talk, conversation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=108" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कथोदय|कथोदयः
कथोदय m. beginning of a tale;<BR> mention, statement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=108" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कद्
क॑द् (Ved. n. acc. sgl. of 1 क) nonne, num? w. neg. &<BR>चन॑ by no means;<BR> क॑च्चिद् & कच्चिन्नु = कद् alone. Often ˚—, where<BR>it marks abnormity or defectiveness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=108" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कदन|कदनं
