कदम्बगोल
कदम्बगोल m. Kadamba blossom (lit. globe)*<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=108" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कदम्बपुष्पत्व
कदम्बपुष्पत्व a. state of a Kadamba blossom (v.<BR>prec.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=108" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कदर्थ|कदर्थः
