कदलिका
कदलिका f. the same;<BR> flag, banner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=108" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कदलीगृह
कदलीगृह n. bower of Kadali trees.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=108" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कदा
कदा॑ adv. when? at what time? how? With न never;<BR> w.<BR>चन the same or at some time, once;<BR> w. चिद् some time or other,<BR>sometimes, perhaps;<BR> w. अपि (later) at any time, always, ever. कदा<BR>चिद्, कदा चिदपि, & कदापि w. न never.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=108" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कद्रु|कद्रुः
क॑द्रु a. tawny, reddish-brown. f. कद्रू॑ a cert.<BR>Soma-vessel;<BR> N. of the mythol mother of serpents (also कद्रु).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=108" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कधप्रिय
कधप्रिय a. ever kind or friendly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=108" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कधप्री
कध˚प्री a. ever kind or friendly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=108" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्
कन् (only pp. का॑यमान, aor. अकानिषम्, & perf. or<BR>intens-stem चाकन् or चकान्) be glad, be satisfied with, enjoy (acc.,<BR>loc., gen., or instr.);<BR> be liked, please, (w. gen.);<BR> love, wish, desire<BR>(acc.). — आ be pleased with (loc.);<BR> strive after, long for. — Cf.<BR>संचकान॑.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=108" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनक|कनकं|कनकः
क॑नक n. gold;<BR> m. N. of sev. plants.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=108" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनकमय
कनकमय f. ई golden.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=108" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनकरस|कनकरसः
कनकरस m. liquid gold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=108" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनकवलय
