कल्
कल् कलयति (कलय˚ते) & कालयति pp. कलित<BR>(q.v.) drive, impel;<BR> carry, bear;<BR> do, make, cause, produce, utter;<BR>observe, notice;<BR> try, examine;<BR> suppose, think, regard as (2 acc.).<BR>—आ shake, agitate, cast, fling;<BR> seize, tie, fasten;<BR> observe, notice;<BR>try, etc. = S. उद् drive out, let loose. उप drive home. निन् drive<BR>out, chase away. परि follow, pursue, seize, devour;<BR> consider or<BR>regard as. प्र drive out, impel, pursue. सम् drive away, put to<BR>flight;<BR> join, combine, be of opinion. — Cf. उत्कलित.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=112" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

