काश्
काश् काशते (काश˚ति) pp. काशित be visible, appear,<BR>shine, be brilliant or pleasant. I. चा॑कशीति & चाकश्य॑ते shine<BR>bright;<BR> see clearly, survey. — अभि I. shine bright upon, illumine;<BR>look on, survey. अव be visible, lie open. निस् C निष्काशयति v.<BR>कस्। प्र be visible, shine, radiate, appear, become clear or manifest.<BR>C. प्रकाशयति (˚ते) make visible, cause to appear, show, unveil,<BR>explain, declare as (acc.). संप्र & C. the same. वि appear. C.<BR>display, spread;<BR> illuminate, irradiate. l. pp. विचा॑कशत् shining,<BR>beaming;<BR> beholding, perceiving. सम् appear, behold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=120" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

