कृत्
1 कृत् कृन्त॑ति कृन्त॑˚ते (कर्तति), pp. कृत्त॑ cut,<BR>cut off, cleave, split, divide, destroy. C. कर्तयति (कृन्तयति)<BR>the same. — अप & अपि cut off. अव cut off, destroy. C. cause to be<BR>gashed. उद् cut out or off, carve, tear asunder, destroy. नि cut or<BR>hew down, cut or tear off;<BR> M. cut one's self (e.g. the nails). C. cause<BR>to be cut. परि cut round, clip, cut off, exclude from (abl.). प्र<BR>cut off or asunder. वि the same, tear to pieces, lacerate, destroy. C.<BR>the same. सम् cut etc. (together).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=129" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कृत्
2 कृत् कृण॑त्ति twist the thread, spin. C. क्र्तयति weave.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=129" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कृत्
3 कृत् a. making, doing, causing, effecting;<BR> maker, performer,<BR>author of (—˚) m. a suffix forming nouns from roots, also = कृदन्त<BR>m.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=129" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कृत|कृतं
कृत॑ a. made, done, prepared, arranged, appointed, got;<BR>present, ready, fit, proper, good. Often ˚— having done, doing using,<BR>showing, betraying etc. —n. it is done, i.e. shall be done instantly;<BR>w. instr. (±सह) be it done with, i.e. away with, enough of! n. as<BR>subst. act, deed, work, esp. religious work, sacrifice, ceremony, etc.;<BR>service, benefit;<BR> stake at game;<BR> booty in battle;<BR> the (lucky) Four-side<BR>of the die;<BR> the first or golden age. कृतेन because or instead of<BR>(gen. or —˚);<BR> कृते the same. abs. for something.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=129" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कृतक|कृतकं|कृतकः
कृतक a. made, prepared, artificial, unnatural. false.<BR>°—& n. adv. — With पुत्र m. an adopted son;<BR> abstr. ˚त्व n.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=129" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कृतकर्तव्य|कृतकर्त्तव्य
