कृतकार्य|कृतकार्य्य
1 कृतकार्य a. the same, satisfied.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=129" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कृतकार्य|कृतकार्य्य
2 कृतकार्य n. an attained object.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=129" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कृतकृत्य|कृतकृत्यः
