कृतकौतुक a. giving pleasure to (gen.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=129" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कृतक्रिय|कृतक्रियः
