कृतज्ञ|कृतज्ञः
कृतज्ञ a. grateful (lit. mindful of benefits).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=129" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कृतत्वर
कृतत्वर a. making haste, being quick.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=129" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

