कृतप्रणय a. enamoured.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=130" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कृतपूर्व|कृतपूर्व्व
कृतपूर्व a. done before.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=130" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कृतपूर्विन्|कृतपूर्व्विन्
