क्रमण|क्रमणः
क्र॑मण m. step;<BR> n. stepping, walking, crossing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=137" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रमदीश्वर
