क्रमप्राप्त
क्रमप्राप्त a. got by succession, hereditary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=137" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रमयोग|क्रमयोगः
