क्रुश्
क्रुश् क्रो॑शति क्रो॑श˚ते pp. क्रुष्ट (w. act. & pass.<BR>mg) cry out, shout, croak, lament;<BR> call to (acc). — अनु shout at<BR>(acc.);<BR> C. show sympathy (lit. follow in lamenting). अभि call or cry<BR>at (acc.), lament, mourn. आ call aloud, scold at, revile, defame;<BR>challenge, emulate. उद् cry out, call to (acc.). उप show anger or<BR>defiance. प्र raise a cry, call at (acc.). वि the same. सम् cry<BR>out together, shout angrily at (acc.). — Cf. अपक्रुष्ट, आक्रुष्ट,<BR>उपक्रुष्ट.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=138" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

