क्व
क्व adv. where? wither? how? Used also as loc. of 1 क॑.<BR>Often connected w. अ॑ह, इ॑द्, इव, नु, स्विद्, w. the latter also =<BR>somewhere. — With चिद् & (later) अपि somewhere, anywhere, at or to a<BR>cert. place. क्व चिद् — क्व चिद् here—there, now—now. क्व w.<BR>negation & अपि, चिद, च, or चन nowhere, in no place. क्व—क्व<BR>where is this? where is that? i.e. how distant or different is this from<BR>that.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=139" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

