खन्
खन् ख॑नति ख॑न˚ते pp. खात dig, dig up, delve,<BR>bury. C. खानयति. — अभि turn up (the soil). उद् root up,<BR>extract, exterminate, destroy. प्रोद् & समुद् the same. नि bury,<BR>inter;<BR> dig up, root up;<BR> infix, pierce. निस् dig out. परि dig round,<BR>dig up. प्र eradicate, overturn. वि dig up. — Cf. अन्तर्निखात,<BR>उत्खात.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=144" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

