घुष् घो॑षति (घो॑ष˚ते) pp. घुष्ट sound, cry, call<BR>out, proclaim. C. घोष॑यति cause to sound etc., also = S. —अव<BR>proclaim aloud, offer. आ listen to;<BR> also = C. cry aloud, proclaim.<BR>उद् sound, cry aloud. C. proclaim. वि make noise, sound, proclaim.<BR>सम् sound, fill with noise, proclaim, praise, offer. — Cf. उड्घुष्ट<BR>& परिसंघुष्ट.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=163" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

