च|चः
च (encl.) and, also;<BR> even, just;<BR> but, yet;<BR> if. It is often<BR>joined with अपि & एव. — च—च as well—as, both-and (also<BR>च—तु), no sooner-than, although — yet;<BR> w. neg. neither—nor.<BR>च—न च (तु) although — yet not, न च—च although<BR>not—nevertheless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=164" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

