चमत्करण|चमत्करणं
चमत्करण n. ˚कार m., ˚कृति f. astonishment,<BR>amazement, surprise, wonder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=168" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

