चमूपति|चमूपतिः
चमू˚पति m. leader of an army.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=168" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चमूपाल
चमू˚पाल m. leader of an army.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=168" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चम्प|चंपः|चम्पः
