चित्
1 चित् चे॑तति चे॑त˚ते pp. चित्त॑ (q.v.) perceive,<BR>observe, attend to (gen. or acc.), aim at, intend (dat.), strive after,<BR>desire (acc.), take care of (acc.);<BR> conceive, understand, know;<BR> intr.<BR>appear, be conspicuous or known. C. चेत॑यति, ˚ते & चित॑यति make<BR>attentive, remind, instruct, teach;<BR> notice, put to mind, attend to;<BR> M.<BR>(A.) be conscious or sensible, think, reflect, conceive, understand,<BR>remember;<BR> appear, be conspicuous, shine. D. चिकित्सति (˚ते) intend,<BR>aim at, care for;<BR> treat medically, heal. I. चे॑किते appear, shine.<BR>—आ attend to, call to mind, understand, know, find out, invent;<BR> intr.<BR>appear, shine, excel. प्र become visible, appear, also = C. perceive,<BR>understand, announce, proclaim. वि observe, discern conceive, know<BR>(also C.);<BR> M. be perceptible, appear. D. wish to discern, deliberate,<BR>doubt, hesitate. सम् perceive (together), survey, notice;<BR> be<BR>unanimous, agree. — Cf. चिकित्वं॑स्, चे॑कितान, वि॑चित्त.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=172" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

