चुद्
चुद् चो॑दति चो॑द˚ते impel, incite, urge;<BR> M. hasten,<BR>speed. C. चोद॑यति (˚ते) = S. + animate, accelerate, press;<BR> inspire,<BR>excite;<BR> turn, cast, direct;<BR> start (trans.), further, help on, bring or<BR>offer quickly;<BR> settle, fix. — अभि C. incite, encourage, summon,<BR>invite, request, command;<BR> ask, inquire for (acc.). परि C. set in<BR>motion, impel, summon, request. प्र push on, impel. C. the same +<BR>animate, inspire, inflame, summon, urge, request, command, etc. (v.<BR>अभि). सम् C. set in motion, impel, excite, inflame, summon,<BR>request, solicit;<BR> speed, procure quickly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=174" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

