चेष्ट्
चेष्ट् चे॑ष्टति चे॑ष्ट˚ते pp. चेष्टित (q.v.) move the<BR>limbs, stir, exert one's self, be active or busy, be engaged in (acc.);<BR>act or behave towards (loc.);<BR> make, do, perform. C. चेष्टयति, ˚ते set<BR>in motion, impel. — आ make, perform. परि wallow, roam about. वि<BR>move the limbs, writhe, struggle, stir, be active or busy, act or behave<BR>towards (loc.), effect, produce. सम् be restless, exert one's self,<BR>act. — Cf. विचेष्टित.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=175" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

