छद्
1 छद् only pp. छन्न (q.v.) & C. छाद॑यति (˚ते)<BR>cover, veil, hide, conceal, keep secret. —अभि C. cover. अव C.<BR>cover, overspread, hide, veil, obscure, conceal. आ C. cover, clothe<BR>(M. also refl.), hide, obscure. परि C. wrap round, envelop, cover.<BR>प्र C. cover (M. refl.), hide, veil in (instr.), conceal, keep secret.<BR>प्रति C. overspread, clothe, envelop. सम् the same. — Cf.<BR>अवच्छन्न, आच्छन्न, उपच्छन्न, परिच्छन्न, प्रच्छन्न,<BR>प्रतिच्छन्न, संछन्न.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=176" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

