1 जन्य a. born, produced, rising from (—˚);<BR> abstr. ˚ता<BR>f., ˚त्व n. — n. body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=181" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जन्य|जन्यं|जन्यः
2 ज॑न्य a. belonging to the (same) race, national, native;<BR>common, vulgar. — m. the bridegroom's friend;<BR> f. आ bridesmaid;<BR> n.<BR>people, tribe, race (also जन्य॑), pl. inimical tribes;<BR> fighting, war.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=181" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जन्ययात्रा
जन्ययात्रा f. the procession of the bridegroom's<BR>friend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=181" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जप्
जप् ज॑पति ज॑प˚ते pp. जपित & जप्त whisper,<BR>mutter, esp. prayers, invoke in a low voice. — आ mutter into<BR>(कर्णे). उप whisper to i.e. bring over secretly. सम् whisper or<BR>talk about.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=181" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जप|जपः
ज॑प a. whispering, muttering;<BR> m. muttering prayers, a<BR>muttered prayer or spell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=181" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जपन|जपनं
जपन n. = prec. m.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=181" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जपमाला
जपमाला f. a rosary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=181" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जपयज्ञ|जपयज्ञः
जपयज्ञ m. a sacrifice consisting of muttered prayers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=181" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जपहोम|जपहोमः
जपहोम m. sgl. & pl. the same or ( = du.) muttered<BR>prayers and ablations.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=181" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जपा
जपा f. the China rose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=181" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जपापीड
जपापीड m. a garland of Japa flowers.*<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=181" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जपिन्
जपिन् a. muttering prayers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=181" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जप्य|जप्यः
ज॑प्य a. the same;<BR> n. (m.) whisper or prayer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=181" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जभ्
जभ् जम्भ् snap at (अ॑पि), seize with the mouth. C.<BR>जम्भ॑यति crush, destroy. I. जन्जभ्यते open the jaws, snap at;<BR>w. अभि the same.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=181" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जमदग्नि|जमदग्निः
जम॑दग्नि m. N. of a Ṛṣi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=181" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जम्बाल|जंबाल|जंबालः|जम्बालः
