जम्बीर|जंबीर|जंबीरः|जम्बीरः
जम्बीर m. the citron tree;<BR> n. a citron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=181" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जम्बु|जंबु|जम्बुः
जम्बु f. the rose-apple tree;<BR> n. its fruit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=181" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जम्बू|जंबू
जम्बू f. the rose-apple tree;<BR> n. its fruit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=181" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जम्बुक|जंबुक|जंबुकः|जम्बुकः
जम्बुक m. a jackal (used also as an abusive word).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=181" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जम्बुद्वीप|जंबुद्वीप|जम्बुद्वीपः
जम्बुद्वीप m. the continent abounding in rose-apple<BR>trees, i.e. India, thought as one of the 7 Dvipas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=181" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जम्बूक|जंबूक|जंबूकः|जम्बूकः
