जम्भक|जंभक|जम्भकः
ज॑म्भक a. crushing, devouring (—˚);<BR> m. E. of cert.<BR>demons.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=182" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जम्भन|जंभनं
