जम्भलिका
जम्भलिका f. a kind of song.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=182" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जम्भ्य
ज॑म्भ्य m. front- or back-tooth;<BR> pl. the jaws.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=182" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जय|जयः
1 ज॑य a. conquering, winning (—˚);<BR> pl. cert. verses or<BR>formulas causing victory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=182" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जय|जयः
2 जय॑ m. conquest, victory, gain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=182" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जयकुञ्जर|जयकुञ्जरः
