जयपराजय
जयपराजय (m. du. & n. sgl.) victory or defeat,<BR>gain or loss.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=182" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जयप्रेप्सु
