जरा
1 जरा॑ f. v. ज॑र.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=182" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जरा
