जृम्भ्|जृंभ्
जृम्भ् जृम्भते (जृम्भ˚ति), pp. जृम्भित (q.v.)<BR>gape, yawn, open (of a flower), blossom;<BR> spread, extend;<BR> come forth,<BR>rise;<BR> be or feel at ease. C. जृम्भयति cause to yawn. 1.<BR>जरी-जृम्भते extend far. — उद् & समुद् open wide, come forth,<BR>appear, arise. परि spread round. प्र begin to yawn. वि yawn,<BR>gape, blossom, expand, break forth, appear;<BR> be or feel at ease. सम्<BR>expand, break forth, appear. — Cf. विजृम्भित.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=188" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

