तळि॑तस् ( = तडित् & तडितस्) adv. closely, near.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=193" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडित्
तडित् f. lightning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=193" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडित्वन्त्|तडित्वत्
तडित्वन्त् a. having or emitting a flash of lightning;<BR> m.<BR>a cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=193" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडिन्मय
तडिन्मय a. consisting of lightning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडिन्माला
तडिन्माला f. flash of lightning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडिल्लता
तडिल्लता f. the same.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडिल्लेखा
तडि˚ल्लेखा f. the same.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तण्डुल|तंडुल|तंडुलः|तण्डुलः
