तण्डुलकण|तण्डुलकणः
तण्डुलकण m. a grain of rice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तण्डुलकण्डन
तण्डुलकण्डन n. rice-bran.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तण्डुलोदक|तण्डुलोदकं
तण्डुलोदक n. rice-water.*<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत|ततं|ततः
1 तत॑ m. father;<BR> voc. also = my son.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत|ततं|ततः
2 तत॑ a. stretched out, expanded, wide;<BR> overspread or<BR>covered with (instr. or —˚).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ततस्
त॑तस् (adv. abl. of त॑) thence, there, thither;<BR> then,<BR>therefore. —ततस्ततम् & इतस्ततस् (from) here and there, (from)<BR>everywhere;<BR> the former also interr. = ततः किम् what then? ततः<BR>परम् moreover, further, also = ततः पश्चात् thereupon, afterwards.<BR>ततःप्रभृति (or तत आरभ्य*) thenceforth, since. ततोऽन्यतस्<BR>elsewhere. ततोऽपरम् later, afterwards. यतस्ततस् from what<BR>(person or place) soever, (from) wherever. यतोयतस् (from)<BR>wheresoever;<BR> correl. ततस्ततस्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तति|ततिः
1 त॑ति (only as pl.) so many.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तति|ततिः
2 तति f. extension, spreading, offering (of a sacrifice);<BR>multitude, abundance, high degree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ततिथ
ततिथ॑ f. रि॑ the so maniest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ततिधा
ततिधा॑ adv. so manifold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ततुरि|ततुरिः
त॑तुरि a. overcoming, victorious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ततोमुख
ततोमुख a. directed thither.*<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्कर्तृ
तत्कर्तृ a. doing that.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्कर्मकारिन्
तत्कर्मकारिन् a. performing the same action.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्कारण
तत्कारण a. doing or causing that.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्कारिन्
तत्कारिन् a. doing the same.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्कार्यकारणात्
तत्कार्यकारणात् (abl. adv.) for that (precise)<BR>reason.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्काल|तत्कालः
1 तत्काल m. that time, the time (now or then) being;<BR>(˚—*) or acc. = at or during that time, just, directly, immediately.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्काल|तत्कालः
2 तत्काल a. happening at the same time or immediately.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्कालवेदिन्
तत्कालवेदिन् a. knowing that time.*<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्कालीन
तत्कालीन a. = 2 तत्काल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्कृत
तत्कृत a. caused by that (those);<BR> loc. therefore.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्क्षण|तत्क्षणः
तत्क्षण m. the same moment;<BR> ˚—, acc., abl., & loc. at<BR>the same moment, just, immediately, forthwith.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्तुल्य
तत्तुल्य a. equal or corresponding to, worthy of that<BR>(those).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्त्व|तत्त्वं
तत्त्व n. the state of being that, i.e. the true state or<BR>real nature;<BR> truth, reality, first principle (ph.). ˚—, instr., & adv.<BR>in तस् in truth, really, exactly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्त्वकथन
तत्त्वकथन n. telling the truth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्त्वज्ञ|तत्त्वज्ञः
तत्त्वज्ञ a. knowing the truth or true state of (—˚).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्त्वज्ञान|तत्त्वज्ञानं
