तत्त्वदर्शिन्
तत्त्वदर्शिन् a. seeing or knowing the truth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्त्वदृश्
तत्त्व˚दृश् a. seeing or knowing the truth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्त्वबोध
तत्त्वबोध m. = तत्त्वज्ञान.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्त्वभाव|तत्त्वभावः
तत्त्वभाव m. true being or nature.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्त्वभूत
तत्त्वभूत a. being truth, i.e. true.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्त्वविद्
तत्त्वविद् a. = तत्त्वज्ञ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्त्वशुद्धि|तत्त्वशुद्धिः
तत्त्वशुद्धि f. exact knowledge of the truth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्त्वाख्यानोपमा
तत्त्वाख्यानोपमा f. & तत्त्वापह्वरूपक n. two<BR>kinds of comparison ((rh.)).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्त्वाभियोग|तत्त्वाभियोगः
तत्त्वाभियोग m. accusation on ground of facts (j.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्त्वार्थ|तत्त्वार्थः
तत्त्वार्थ m. the exact truth;<BR> the true meaning of<BR>(—˚).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्पद
तत्पद n. the place of that or the word तद्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्पर|तत्परः
1 तत्पर a. following that or thereupon, inferior;<BR> abstr.<BR>˚त्व n.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्पर|तत्परः
2 तत्पर a. (lit. = seq.) quite given to or intent upon<BR>(loc. or —˚), abstr. ˚ता f.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्परायण|तत्परायणः
तत्परायण a. having that as highest object.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्पुरुष|तत्पुरुषः
तत्पुरुष m. his servant;<BR> a class of compounds (g.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्प्रतिपादक
तत्प्रतिपादक a. suggesting or teaching that.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्प्रधान
तत्प्रधान a. depending chiefly on that (pers. or<BR>thing).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्प्रयोजक
तत्प्रयोजक a. impelling him (her or them).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्र
त॑त्र (त॑त्रा) adv. = loc. of त॑, there, therein,<BR>then. तत्र तत्र here and there, everywhere. यत्र तत्र (±अपि)<BR>wherever, at every place or time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्रत्य|तत्रत्यः
तत्रत्य a. relating to that place, i.e. being there,<BR>coming thence, etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्रभवन्त्|तत्रभवत्
तत्रभवन्त् f. ˚वती his or her reverence (there).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=194" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्रस्थ
तत्रस्थ a. standing or dwelling there.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=195" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्रान्तरे
तत्रान्तरे (loc. adv.) meanwhile (lit. in that<BR>interval).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=195" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्सख
तत्सख m. his (her, their) friend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=195" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्संख्याक
तत्संख्याक a. being in that number, counting so<BR>much.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=195" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्सम
तत्सम a. equal, of equal meaning to (—˚).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=195" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्समक्षम्
तत्समक्षम् adv. before his (her, their) eyes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=195" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्संबन्धिन्
तत्संबन्धिन् a. connected with that (pers. or th.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=195" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्सहाय
तत्सहाय a. joined with that (those).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=195" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्स्पृष्टिन्
तत्स्पृष्टिन् a. touching that (—˚).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=195" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्स्वरूप
तत्स्वरूप a. having the nature of that.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=195" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तथा
त॑था adv. so, thus;<BR> also, likewise (±च or अपि);<BR> as<BR>well, as truly (in asseverations, correl यथा);<BR> well, surely,<BR>certainly. —तथापि (±तु) even thus, nevertheless, yet (mostly<BR>after यद्यपि or कामम्). तथा हि for thus (it is), for instance,<BR>namely. तथैव (±च) just so. न तथा = अन्यथा (q.v.).<BR>यथा तथा howsoever, anyhow;<BR> w. neg. by no means. यथा यथा-तथा<BR>तथा in what manner or degree, the more — in that manner etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=195" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तथागत|तथागतः
तथागत a. being in that condition, of such a quality<BR>or nature;<BR> m. a Buddhist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=195" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तथागुण
तथागुण a. having such qualities or virtues.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=195" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तथाभाव|तथाभावः
तथाभाव m. the being so.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=195" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तथाभाविन्
तथाभाविन् a. who will be so.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=195" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तथाभूत
तथाभूत a. being so, of such a kind or nature.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=195" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तथारूप
