तथारूपिन्
तथा˚रूपिन् a. of such a form or shape.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=195" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तथाविध
त॑थाविध a. of such a sort or kind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=195" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तथावीर्य
तथावीर्य a. of such strength or power.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=195" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तथाव्रत
