तथ्य|तथ्यं
तथ्य a. real, true;<BR> n. truth, reality;<BR> instr. & ˚तस्<BR>according to truth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=195" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तद्
तद् n. sg. of त॑ (˚— used also as stem), as adv. there,<BR>then;<BR> therefore, accordingly;<BR> now, and;<BR> often connecting two sentences &<BR>correl. to यद्, येन, यतस्, यदि, or चेद्. — तदपि nevertheless,<BR>even;<BR> तद्यथा for instance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=195" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदनन्तर
तदनन्तर a. nearest to that, immediately connected<BR>with (gen.);<BR> n. adv. immediately upon that, thereupon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=195" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदनु
तदनु adv. thereupon, then.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=195" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदनुकृति
तदनुकृति adv. accordingly (to that).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=195" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदनुगुण
तदनुगुण a. answering or corresponding to (—˚).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=195" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदन्त|तदंत
त॑दन्त a. ending with that.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=195" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदन्तर्भूत
तदन्तर्भूत a. being among or within (that).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=195" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदपत्य
तदपत्य a. having offspring by that (woman);<BR> abstr.<BR>˚ता f.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=195" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदपस्
त॑दपस् a. doing that work, used to do that.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=195" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदपेक्ष
तदपेक्ष a. having a regard for that.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=195" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

