तदा
तदा॑ adv. at that time, in that case, then;<BR> sometimes<BR>redundant, esp. before अथ & after ततस् & पुरा. Often strengthened<BR>by एव (तदैव);<BR> correl to यदा, यत्र, यद्, यदि & चेद्. — तदा<BR>प्रभृति thenceforward.<BR>यदा तदा at every time, always.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=195" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदात्मन्
तदात्मन् a. having that nature.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=195" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदात्व|तदात्वं
