तदानीम्
तदा॑नीम् adv. at that time, then.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=195" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

