तद्भागिन्
तद्भागिन् a. responsible for that.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=195" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तद्युत
तद्युत a. joined with that (pers. or thing), together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=196" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तद्युक्त
तद्युक्त a. joined with that (pers. or thing), together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=196" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तद्रूप
तद्रूप a. thus shaped or formed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=196" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तद्वंश्य
तद्वंश्य a. being of that race.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=196" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तद्वक्तृ
तद्वक्तृ a. teaching that.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=196" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तद्वचन
तद्वचन a. expressing or meaning that.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=196" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तद्वत्|तद्वन्त्
तद्वत् adv. so, in that manner (correl. to यद्वत् or<BR>यथा);<BR> likewise, also.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=196" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तद्वत्ता
तद्वत्ता f. abstr. to prec.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=196" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तद्वयस्
तद्वयस् a. being the same age.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=196" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तद्वश
तद्वश॑ a. desirous of that.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=196" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तद्विद्
तद्वि॑द् a. = तज्ज्ञ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=196" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तद्विध
तद्विध a. of that kind, answering to that;<BR> abstr.<BR>˚त्व n.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=196" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तद्विषय
तद्विषय a. having that for object, relating to that.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=196" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तद्वृत्ति
तद्वृत्ति a. living according to that.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=196" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तन्
1 तन् तनो॑ति तनुते॑ pp. तत॑ (q.v.) extend, stretch,<BR>spread (intr. & tr.);<BR> last, continue;<BR> protract, prolong, lengthen;<BR> spin<BR>out, weave (l.&f.);<BR> prepare, arrange, direct, accomplish, perform,<BR>compose, make. P. ताय॑ते be extended, increase, grow. — अधि<BR>string (the bow), cover. अनु extend along (intr.), continue;<BR> carry on,<BR>maintain. अभि extend or reach over (acc);<BR> spread out, unfold, place<BR>in front. अव sink down;<BR> overspread, cover;<BR> loosen, let off (esp. the<BR>bow-string). आ spread over, penetrate, cover (esp. with light);<BR>expand, diffuse, stretch (a bow);<BR> bring forth, produce, effect, show,<BR>betray. अन्वा stretch or reach over;<BR> spread (tr. & intr.). व्या<BR>diffuse, produce, effect. समा the same, stretch (esp. the bow).<BR>परि stretch around, surround, envelop. प्र spread, extend (tr. &<BR>intr.);<BR> cause, produce;<BR> show, betray. वि spread over, cover, fill,<BR>stretch out (a cord, web, etc.) string (a bow);<BR> diffuse, extend;<BR>prepare, arrange, sacrifice;<BR> produce, effect;<BR> make, render (2 acc.).<BR>सम् join one's self with, hold together;<BR> cover, fill;<BR> connect,<BR>continue, protract;<BR> effect, accomplish;<BR> exhibit, evince. अनुसम् add,<BR>join, annex;<BR> spread, expand;<BR> carry on, prosecute. — Cf. आ॑तत,<BR>प्रवितत, वि॑तत, स॑तत.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=196" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तन्
2 त॑न् (only dat. & instr.) spreading, continuation,<BR>propagation, offspring;<BR> instr. त॑ना (तना॑) adv. uninterruptedly,<BR>continually.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=196" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तन्
3 †तन् तन्यति roar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=196" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तन|तनः
त॑न n. आ f. offspring, child.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=196" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तनय|तनयः
त॑नय a. propagating a race or belonging to a family. m.<BR>son (du. also son and daughter);<BR> f. तनया daughter;<BR> n. posterity,<BR>offspring, child, descendant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=196" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तनयित्नु
तनयित्नु॑ a. roaring, thundering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=196" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तनस्
त॑नस् n. posterity, offspring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=196" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तनिमन्
त॑निमन् m. thinness, weakness;<BR> n. the liver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=196" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तनिष्ठ|तनिष्ठः
त॑निष्ठ superl. & compar. to seq. तनु॑ (f. तनु,<BR>तनू॑ & तन्वी) thin, slender, small, minute, little, spare (abstr.<BR>˚ता† f., ˚त्व† n.), f. तनु or तनू॑ body, form, nature (abstr.<BR>तनुता f.);<BR> person, esp. one's own person or self (often = a refl.<BR>pron.;<BR> cf. आत्म॑न्). f. तन्वी a (slender) woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=196" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तनीयंस्
त॑नीयंस् superl. & compar. to seq. तनु॑ (f. तनु,<BR>तनू॑ & तन्वी) thin, slender, small, minute, little, spare (abstr.<BR>˚ता† f., ˚त्व† n.), f. तनु or तनू॑ body, form, nature (abstr.<BR>तनुता f.);<BR> person, esp. one's own person or self (often = a refl.<BR>pron.;<BR> cf. आत्म॑न्). f. तन्वी a (slender) woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=196" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तनुगात्र
तनुगात्र f. ई slender (-limbed).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=196" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तनुच्छद|तनुच्छदः
तनुच्छद m. feather, pl. plumage;<BR> armour, attire<BR>(lit. what covers the body).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=196" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तनुज|तनुजः
तनुज m. आ f. son, daughter (born from the body or<BR>self).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=196" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तनुत्यज्
तनुत्यज् a. giving up one's person.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=196" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तनुत्याग
तनुत्याग m. giving up or risk of one's own life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=196" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तनुत्र|तनुत्रं
तनुत्र n. armour, mail (lit. body-protector).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=196" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तनुत्राण|तनुत्राणं
