तारकाराज
तारकाराज m. the moon (lord of the stars).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=202" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

