तालपत्त्र
तालपत्त्र n. leaf of the fan-palm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=202" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालफल
तालफल n. the nut of the fan-palm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=202" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

