तु
1 तु तवीति be strong. — उद् & सम् (1. त॑वीत्वत्)<BR>effect, bring about.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=204" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तु
2 तु॑ (तू॑) (indecl.) pray, do (w. imperat.);<BR> but, on the<BR>contrary (±एव॑ or वै);<BR> often only explet. — किं तु & परं तु<BR>yet, however (esp. after a concess. sent.);<BR> न तु yet not,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=205" target="_blank">Page205</a>]<BR>rather than (esp. after कामम्, भूयस्, वरम् etc.). तु—तु on the<BR>one hand — on the other, indeed — but.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=204" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

