तृप्
तृप् तृ॑प्यति (तृ॑प्य˚ते), तृप्णो॑ति (तृप्नोति),<BR>तृम्प॑ति (तर्पति), pp. तप्त॑ satiate one's self, be satisfied or<BR>content with (gen., instr. or —˚);<BR> enjoy (abl.). C. तर्प॑यति, ˚ते<BR>satisfy, please, nourish;<BR> M. refl. — अभि C. satiate, refresh. आ be<BR>satiated or satisfied;<BR> C. satiate. परि C. satiate or refresh<BR>thoroughly. प्र C. satiate, fill. वि be satiated or pleased. सम्<BR>be satiated or satisfied with (gen.). C. satiate, refresh, gladden.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=208" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

