त्रसरेणु|त्रसरेणुः
त्रसरेणु m. mote of dust, atom.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=211" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रस्तनयन
त्रस्तनयन a. looking timid (lit. having frightened<BR>eyes).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=211" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

