त्वादत्त
त्वा॑दत्त a. given by thee.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=215" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्वादात
त्वा॑दात a. given by thee.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=215" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्वादूत
त्वादूत a. having thee as a messenger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=215" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

