त्वादृश
त्वादृ˚श f. ˚शी like thee, of thy kind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=215" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्वायन्त्|त्वायत्
