त्वाया
त्वा॑या (instr. adv.) out of love towards thee, for thy sake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=215" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्वायु
