त्वावन्त्|त्वावत्
त्वा॑वन्त् a. like thee.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=215" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्वाष्ट्र|त्वाष्ट्रः
त्वाष्ट्र॑ a. belonging to Tvaṣṭṛ;<BR> m. his son, a<BR>patron. name.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=215" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्वाष्ट्र|त्वाष्ट्रः
