दस्म॑ a. miraculous, extraordinary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=221" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दस्मन्त्|दस्मत्
दस्म॑न्त् a. miraculous, extraordinary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=221" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दस्मवर्चस्
दस्म॑वर्चस् a. of miraculous strength.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=221" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दस्म्य
