दस्यु|दस्युः
द॑स्यु m. foe, enemy (either a superhuman enemy, an evil<BR>demon, or an enemy of the gods, an unbeliever or barbarian, opp.<BR>आर्य).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=221" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

