1 दा॑तृ दातृ॑ a. giving (esp. in marriage), bestowing,<BR>granting, conceding, paying;<BR> imparting, teaching;<BR> causing, producing<BR>(gen. or —˚);<BR> liberal, generous. m. giver, donor;<BR> payer, creditor.<BR>Abstr. ˚ता† f., ˚त्व† n.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=222" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

