दिव्यवर्मभृत् a. wearing a celestial armour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=226" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिव्यविज्ञानवन्त्|दिव्यविज्ञानवत्
दिव्यविज्ञानवन्त् a. = दिव्यज्ञान.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=226" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिव्यसंकाश
दिव्यसंकाश a. heaven-like, divine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=226" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

