दिव्याकृति
दिव्याकृति a. of heavenly appearance, very beautiful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=226" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

