दीक्षा
दीक्षा॑ f. preparation or consecration for a religious<BR>ceremony, initiation;<BR> dedication, devotion to (—˚);<BR> personif. as the<BR>wife of Soma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=227" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दीक्षापति|दीक्षापतिः
