दीक्षित|दीक्षितः
दीक्षित॑ f. ˚ती consecrated for (dat., loc., instr., or<BR>—˚), prepared, ready for (dat., instr., loc., or —˚);<BR> abstr. ˚त्व†<BR>n. — Often ˚— or —˚ in names, esp. of Brahmans.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=227" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दीति|दीतिः
