दीदि
†दीदि 3 pl. दीद्यति intr. shine, gleam, be bright or<BR>visible, please;<BR> tr. bestow by shining (dat. or loc. of pers., acc. of<BR>th.). —अभि bestow by shining. आ shine upon. नि = S. tr. प्र<BR>shine forth. सम् shine together, also = S. tr. — Cf. दी॑द्यत्,<BR>दी॑द्यान, दीदिव॑स्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=227" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दीदिति|दीदितिः
