दीधि
दीधि दी॑ध्ये अ॑दीप्देत् pp. धीत॑ (q.v.) appear,<BR>seem (A.);<BR> perceive, look at (acc.);<BR> think, consider (±मनसा),<BR>desire. —अनु observe, think over. अभि think of, consider. आ<BR>attend to, care for (gen.), make up one's mind. उद् look up to (acc.).<BR>प्रति hope, expect. वि hesitate, be irresolute. — Cf. दी॑ध्यत् &<BR>दी॑ध्यान.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=227" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

