दीप्
दीप् दी॑प्यते दीप्य॑ते (दीप्यति), pp. दीप्त (q.v.) blaze,<BR>flame, shine, be brilliant (l.&f.). C. दीप॑यति, ˚ते kindle,<BR>inflame, illuminate;<BR> excite, raise. I. देदीप्यते blaze brightly, be<BR>radiant. —आ C. inflame, kindle. उद् flame up, burn;<BR> C. = S. C. उप<BR>C. kindle, set fire to (acc.). प्र flame forth. burn. C. kindle,<BR>inflame, rouse. वि blaze, flame;<BR> C. kindle, illuminate. सम् flame;<BR>C. inflame, excite. — Cf. अतिदीप्त, आदीप्तप्रदीप्त, स॑दीप्त.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=227" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दीप|दीपः
दीप m. light, lamp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=228" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दीपक|दीपकं|दीपकः
दीपक a. kindling, inflaming, illuminating;<BR> m. & f.<BR>दीपिका = prec.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=228" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दीपद
दीपद a. who gives a lamp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=228" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दीपन|दीपनं|दीपनः
दीपन f. ई kindling, inflaming^1 (lit. & fig.);<BR> n. the act<BR>of kindling etc.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by AnnaRybakovaT, Jim Funderburk. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=228" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दीपमाला
