दीप्तवीर्य
दीप्तवीर्य a. of fiery strength.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=228" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दीप्ताक्ष|दीप्ताक्षः
