दृ
1 दृ दृणा॑ति (द॑र्षि), pp. दीर्ण॑ burst, break asunder,<BR>split open (tr. & intr.);<BR> P. दीर्य॑ते (˚ति) the same (intr.). C.<BR>दर॑यति & दारयति (˚ते) = S. tr. + drive asunder, disperse,<BR>scatter. I. (st. दर्दृ & दादृ) = S. tr. —अव S. & C. split,<BR>break, burst asunder (tr.);<BR> P. the same (intr.). आ split, go asunder;<BR>also = I. rend, break, open, make accessible. निस् S. & C. rend, split,<BR>cleave. परि M. rend on all sides, P. peel or drop off on all sides<BR>(skin). प्र break, tear;<BR> P. split, open, burst asunder (intr.). वि<BR>split, tear, rend asunder, open;<BR> P. burst, go asunder;<BR> C. rend or saw in<BR>pieces, break through, open, drive asunder, chase away;<BR> I. split, open<BR>(tr.). — Cf. अवदीर्ण, प॑रिदीर्ण, विदीर्ण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=234" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृ
2 दृ द्रिय॑ते w. आ, आद्रियते (˚ति), pp. आदृत (q.v.)<BR>regard, respect, mind (w. acc. or inf.);<BR> also w. pass. mg. —अत्या have<BR>much regard or consideration. प्रत्या be regardful towards (acc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=234" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

