दृढधन्वन्
दृढधन्वन् a. having a strong bow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=235" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृढधन्विन्
दृढ˚धन्विन् a. having a strong bow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=235" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृढनिश्चय
दृढनिश्चय a. of firm determination, resolute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=235" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

