दृढीकरण|दृढीकरणं
दृढीकरण n. ˚कार m. making firm, confirmation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=235" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृति|दृतिः
