दृशि|दृशिः
दृशि f. seeing, power of sight, eye, poss. ˚मन्त्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=235" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृशीक
