दृशीका
दृशीका॑ f. sight, appearance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=235" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृशीक
दृशीक॑ a. looking at (—˚);<BR> m. spectator.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=235" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृशेन्य
