द्रु|द्रुः
1 द्रु द्र॑वति (˚ते), pp. द्रुत॑ (q.v.)<BR>run, hasten, flee;<BR> become fluid, melt (l.&f.). C. द्राव॑य˚ते), pp.<BR>द्रुत॑ (q.v.) run, hasten, flee;<BR> become fluid, melt (l.&f.). C.<BR>द्राव॑यति (˚ते). — अति run past (acc.). अधि run towards,<BR>mount, leap upon, cover. अनु run after, follow, pursue;<BR> run through<BR>i.e. recite quickly. अप run away. अभि run near, hasten towards,<BR>attack, assail;<BR> visit, befall. आ run near, approach. समा run<BR>(together) towards or against (acc.). उद् run up or out. उप & समुप<BR>rush at (acc.);<BR> attack, visit, befall. निस् run out or away. परि run<BR>about. प्र hasten, on, rush at (acc.);<BR> run away, flee, escape. विप्र<BR>run asunder, also = संप्र run away, flee. वि run asunder or away,<BR>flee. C. drive away, chase, put to flight. सम् run together. — Cf.<BR>विद्रुत.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=242" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

