धम्
धम् (ध्मा), ध॑मति (˚ते), pp. धमित॑ & ध्मात॑<BR>blow, exhale;<BR> kindle (fire by blowing), melt (ore). — अनु blow upon.<BR>अप blow off. अभि blow at, terrify by blowing. आ inflate, blow,<BR>sound, proclaim aloud;<BR> P. be inflated or puffed up. उपा & समुपा<BR>blow, sound. उद् exhale, breathe out, proclaim. उप blow at (acc.).<BR>निस् & परा blow away. प्र blow forth, blow away i.e. terrify by<BR>blowing, blow at (acc.);<BR> M. proclaim aloud. C. blow into (a conchshell),<BR>sound. वि blow i.e. drive asunder, scatter, disperse, destroy. सम्<BR>blow or melt together;<BR> proclaim aloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=247" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

