धृष्
धृष् धृष्णो॑ति ध॑र्षति pp. धृषित॑ & धृष्ट॑ q.v.<BR>be bold, dare or venture to (inf.), defy (acc.). C. धर्षयति, pp.<BR>धर्षित attack, injure, violate;<BR> M. overwhelm. — अप overwhelm,<BR>conquer. अभि S. & C. the same. आ venture against, attack. C.<BR>injure, offend. प्र venture against, assail, injure, harass. C. the<BR>same + violate (a woman), destroy, lay waste. संप्र C. assail, defy.<BR>प्रति hold out against, withstand. वि C. venture against, injure,<BR>harass, also = seq. सम् C. violate (a woman), destroy. — Cf.<BR>आधृ॑षे & धृष॑न्त्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=256" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

