नद्
नद् न॑दति (न॑द˚ते) sound, roar, cry, hum (±स्वनम्,<BR>शब्दम्, etc.). C. नद॑यति or नादयति, ˚ते, pp. नादित (q.v.)<BR>make resound. I. ना॑नदति (3. pl.) sound violently, howl, neigh.<BR>—अनु & अभि sound towards (acc.);<BR> C. (also व्यनु) make resound, fill<BR>with noise. उद् & समुद् sound, howl. roar, cry. उप C. make<BR>resound. नि sound, cry out, shriek;<BR> C. = prec. C. प्र (णदति)<BR>begin to cry or roar. प्रति sound back, answer with a cry or howl.<BR>वि sound, cry, roar (±रवम्, स्वनम्, etc.), also = C. make resound,<BR>fill<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=260" target="_blank">Page260</a>]<BR>with noise. सम् sound, roar, cry out. C. = prec. C., abs.<BR>cry aloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=259" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

