नश्
1 नश् न॑श्यति (˚ते) &<BR>न॑शति (˚ते), pp. नष्ट॑ (q.v.) be lost or missing, vanish,<BR>disappear, wane, perish, fly, escape, be gone. C. नाश॑यति (˚ते),<BR>pp. नाशित make disappear, expel, destroy, violate, deflower;<BR> lose,<BR>also from memory, i.e. forget. — अप be gone. अव wane, disappear.<BR>निस् C. expel, drive away. प्र (णश्यति) be lost, disappear, run<BR>away. विप्र be lost, vanish, have no effect or result. संप्र<BR>disappear, cease. वि be lost, vanish, perish, have no effect or<BR>success;<BR> be deprived of (abl.). C. make disappear, destroy, annihilate,<BR>kill. अनुवि disappear or perish after (acc.). — Cf. प्रनष्ट,<BR>विनष्ट, विप्रनष्ट.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=264" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नश्
