नह्
नह् न॑ह्यति (नहति), pp. नद्ध॑ (q.v.) tie, bind<BR>on;<BR> M. put on, esp. armour, arm one's self. C. नाहयति cause to tie<BR>together. — अप unbind, loosen. अपि or पि tie on, fasten, bind<BR>under, cover, obstruct. अव bind on, put over, cover. आ bind on;<BR> M.<BR>be stopped up. उद् push off, remove;<BR> break forth, rise from (abl.).<BR>उप tie up, bind together. परि tie round, gird, encircle. सम् tie<BR>together, bind over, fasten;<BR> gird, clothe, arm (M. refl.);<BR> A.M. put on,<BR>make ready or prepare to (inf.). — Cf. अ॑पिनद्ध, आनद्ध, उन्नद्ध,<BR>नि॑नद्ध, परिणद्ध, वि॑नद्ध, स॑नद्ध.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=264" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नहन
