नियतव्रत
नियतव्रत a. firm in one's vow or faith, faithful,<BR>pious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=271" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

