नु|नुः
1 नु॑ (indecl.) now, still, then, indeed (esp. in questions<BR>±खलु);<BR> -ever or -soever (w. a rel., which it makes indefin.);<BR> w.<BR>neg. certainly not, never. —नू॑ चिद् just now, for ever;<BR> never, never<BR>more;<BR> नु—नु (—नु) either-or (-or), also in questions without an<BR>interr. pron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=284" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नू
1 नू॑ (indecl.) now, still, then, indeed (esp. in questions<BR>±खलु);<BR> -ever or -soever (w. a rel., which it makes indefin.);<BR> w.<BR>neg. certainly not, never. —नू॑ चिद् just now, for ever;<BR> never, never<BR>more;<BR> नु—नु (—नु) either-or (-or), also in questions without an<BR>interr. pron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=284" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नु|नुः
2 नु नौति नुव॑ति न॑वते न॑व˚ति pp. नुत roar,<BR>sound, exult, praise. I. नो॑नवीति, न॑वीनोत् howl, thunder. —अच्छ<BR>call or shout to (acc.). अनु I. cheer after (acc.). अभि hail, shout<BR>to (acc.). आ M. sound, scream;<BR> I. sound through (acc.). प्र roar,<BR>sound, howl, hum, utter (esp. the syllable Om). अभिप्र shout to, hail<BR>(acc.). सम् sound or roar together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=284" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नु|नुः
3 नु न॑वते (नौति) move (trans & intr.);<BR> C. नावयति<BR>move from a place, remove. —अप A. lay, by. अभि & अव M. turn to<BR>(acc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=284" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

