नुद्
1 नुद् नुद॑ति नुद॑˚ते pp. नुत्त॑ & नुन्न push,<BR>thrust;<BR> impel, incite;<BR> expel, drive away, remove, reject. C. नोदयति<BR>impel. I. नोनुद्यते drive away repeatedly, chase. —अप, व्यप, अपा &<BR>व्यपा push or drive away, chase, remove. निस् push out, expel, remove,<BR>reject. परा push away, chase, remove. प्र push or drive away,<BR>chase;<BR> impel, incite. प्रति push back, repel, avert. वि drive<BR>asunder or away;<BR> strike, wound. C. drive away, pass or spend (time);<BR>divert, amuse;<BR> delight in, enjoy (instr.). सम् press or bring<BR>together. C. bring near, fetch;<BR> impel, incite. उपसम् = prec. S.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=284" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नुद्
2 नुद् (—˚) chasing, removing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=284" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

