1 नृत् नृ॑त्यति (नृ॑त्य˚ते) pp. नृत्त॑ dance;<BR> play, act,<BR>represent (d.). C. नर्त॑यति (˚ते) cause to dance or to move to and<BR>fro. I. नरिनर्त्ति, नरीनर्त्ति, नरीनृत्यति, ˚ते<BR>(cause to) dance about or to and fro. —अनु dance after<BR>or before (acc.). आ dance or hasten near. C. cause to dance or move<BR>gently. उप dance before (acc.). परि dance about (acc.). प्र<BR>dance (forwards), begin to dance. सम् dance together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=284" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

