पयोधा॑ a. sucking milk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=296" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पयोधारा
पयोधारा f. stream of water;<BR> ˚गृह n. bathing-room.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=296" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पयोधि|पयोधिः
पयोधि m. the ocean (receptacle of waters).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=296" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पयोनिधि|पयोनिधिः
पयोनिधि m. the ocean (receptacle of waters).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=296" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पयोभृत्
पयोभृत् m. a cloud (water-holder).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=296" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पयोमय
पयोमय a. consisting of water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=296" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पयोमुख
पयोमुख a. showing milk on the surface.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=296" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पयोमुच्
पयोमुच्^1 a. yielding milk (water);<BR> m. cloud.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20160412. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/CORRECTIONS/issues/275. note: last line of scan column.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=296" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पयोराशि|पयोराशिः
पयोराशि m. the sea (mass of water).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=296" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पयोवाह|पयोवाहः
पयोवाह m. a cloud (water-bearer).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=296" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पयोवृध्
पयोवृ॑ध् a. succulent, overflowing, exuberant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=296" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पयोव्रत|पयोव्रतः
प॑योव्रत a. living on mere milk ((r.)).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=296" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पयोष्णी
पयोष्णी f. N. of a river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=296" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर|परं|परः
प॑र a. far, distant, different;<BR> either in space, i.e.<BR>remote, opposite, foreign, hostile — or in time, i.e past, previous,<BR>former, ancient, old;<BR> subsequent, future, later, last, extreme;<BR> — or in<BR>number, order, & degree, i.e. exceeding, more than;<BR> following, standing<BR>after, worse, worst;<BR> surpassing, superior, better, best (in the compar.<BR>mgs mostly w. abl. or —˚). —m. another, stranger, foe, the supreme<BR>Spirit, the Absolute, a man's name. n. remotest distance, highest point<BR>or degree, final beatitude;<BR> chief matter or occupation, esp. adj. —˚<BR>quite consisting of, filled with, devoted to, intent upon;<BR> as adv. &<BR>prep. beyond, after (abl.);<BR> hereafter, next, moreover, further (±अतस्,<BR>इतस्, or ततस्), excessively, beyond measure;<BR> at the best, at the<BR>utmost;<BR> at least, at any rate;<BR> but, however (±तु or किं तु). —<BR>Abstr. परता f., ˚त्व॑ n.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=296" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परकथा
परकथा f. pl. talk about others.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=296" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परकार्य
परकार्य n. another's business.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=296" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परकीय|परकीयं
परकीय a. belonging to another, strange, inimical;<BR>abstr. ˚त्व n.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=296" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परकृत्य
परकृत्य n. = परकार्य.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=296" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परक्षेत्र|परक्षेत्रं
परक्षेत्र n. another's field or wife.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=296" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परच्छिद्र|परच्छिद्रं|परछिद्र
परच्छिद्र n. another's fault or flaw.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=296" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परजन|परजनः
परजन m. strangers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=296" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परतस्
परतस् adv. farther, thereafter, then, as prep. after,<BR>beyond, above (abl.);<BR> often = abl. of प॑र.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=296" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परत्र|परत्रं
परत्र adv. elsewhere, in another world, here-after (w.<BR>भीरु anxious about the other world);<BR> farther on, below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=296" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परदार|परदारः
परदार m. sgl. & pl. another's wife;<BR> adultery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=296" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परदारिन्
परदारिन् a. committing adultery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=296" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परदारोपसेवन
परदारोपसेवन^1 n. ˚सेवा f. intercourse with<BR>another's wife.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20160412. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/CORRECTIONS/issues/275.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=296" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परदेश|परदेशः
परदेश m. foreign or hostile country.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=296" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परदोषज्ञ
परदोषज्ञ a. knowing another's faults.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=296" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परद्रव्य
परद्रव्य n. another's property or goods.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=296" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परधन
परधन n. another's wealth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=297" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

