परपक्ष|परपक्षः
परपक्ष m. the party of the foe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=297" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परपरिग्रह|परपरिग्रहः
परपरिग्रह m. another's property or wife.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=297" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परपाक
परपाक m. food or meal of a stranger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=297" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

