परपुरंजय
परपुरंजय a. conquering the foe's city or<BR>cities.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=297" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परपुरुष|परपुरुषः
