परपुष्ट|परपुष्टः
परपुष्ट m. आ f. the Kokila or Indian cuckoo (lit.<BR>nourished by a stranger, sc. the crow).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=297" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परपूरुष
परपूरुष m. = परपुरुष.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=297" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परपूर्वा|परपूर्व्वा
परपूर्वा f. a woman who has had a former husband,<BR>˚पति m. the husband of such a woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=297" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परप्रेष्यत्व
परप्रेष्यत्व n. service (of another), slavery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=297" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परभाग|परभागः
परभाग m. supremacy, excellency, might;<BR> abl. ˚तस्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=297" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परभृत|परभृतः
