परम|परमः
परम॑ a. farthest, last, extreme, best or worst, highest,<BR>chiefest;<BR> surpassing, better or worse than (abl.). ˚— as adj. supreme,<BR>chief, adv. highly, exceedingly;<BR> —˚ = पर;<BR> n. परमम् yes, very<BR>well, with pleasure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=297" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमक
परमक (f. ˚मिका) a. utmost, best or worst.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=297" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमत|परमतः
परमत n. the opinion of others.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=297" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमता
परम॑ता f. the highest point, position, or rank.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=297" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमदारुण
परमदारुण a. most dreadful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=297" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमधर्मात्मन्
परमधर्मात्मन् a. very dutiful or virtuous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=297" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमपुमंस्
परमपुमंस् m. the supreme spirit (Viṣṇu).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=297" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमप्रीत
परमप्रीत a. very glad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=297" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमर्षि|परमर्षिः
परमर्षि m. an excellent Ṛṣi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=297" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमसमुदय
परमसमुदय a. quite perfect or satisfactory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=297" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमाक्षर
परमाक्षर n. the highest syllable (i.e. Om) or<BR>Brahman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=297" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमाणु|परमाणुः
परमाणु m. infinitely small part or atom.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=297" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमात्मन्
परमात्मन् m. the supreme spirit, the soul of the<BR>universe;<BR> abstr. ˚त्मत्व.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=297" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमानन्द|परमानन्दः
परमानन्द m. the highest bliss.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=297" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमार्तवत्
परमार्तवत् adv. very mournfully.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=297" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमार्थ|परमार्थः
परमार्थ m. the highest or whole truth, reality<BR>(abstr. ˚ता f.). ˚—, instr., abl., & adv. in तस् really, truly<BR>(˚तः संकल्प्य taking for real*).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=297" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमेश|परमेशः
परमेश m. the supreme lord, i.e. Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=297" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमेश्वर|परमेश्वरः
परमेश्वर m. a rich or noble lord, a prince or king<BR>(abstr. ˚ता f., ˚त्व n.);<BR> also = prec. & E. of sev. gods, f. ई E.<BR>of Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=297" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमेष्ठिन्
परमेष्ठि॑न् a. standing in the highest place, chief,<BR>supreme;<BR> E. of sev. gods (esp. Prajāpati), heroes, or sages.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=297" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमेष्वास|परमेष्वासः
परमेष्वास m. an excellent archer;<BR> abstr. ˚ता f.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=297" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परंपर|परम्पर|परंपरः|परम्परः
