पीड्
पीड् पीड॑यति (पीड॑य˚ते) pp. पीडित (q.v.) press,<BR>squeeze, oppress, suppress, vex, harass, pain, beleaguer (a city),<BR>eclipse (sun or moon). — अभि press against, tread upon, press,<BR>squeeze, vex, pain, beleaguer. अव press down, vex, harass. आ press<BR>out, vex, plague. उद् press upwards or out of. उप press, suppress,<BR>vex, pain. नि press against or together, plague, annoy. निस् press<BR>out or together. परि press together, compress, plague or torment<BR>greatly. प्र press, squeeze, pain. सम् press together, pain,<BR>torment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=317" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

