पुष्
पुष् पु॑ष्यात (पु॑ष्य˚ते, पुष्णाति & पोषति), pp.<BR>पुष्ट॑ (q.v.) intr. thrive, bloom, grow, prosper;<BR> tr. cause to thrive<BR>etc.;<BR> cherish, foster, develop, unfold, display, possess, enjoy. C.<BR>पोषयति cherish, foster, rear, bring up, cause to be nourished by<BR>(instr.). —उद् (उत्पुष्णाति) nourish, make fat. उप = S.* - Cf.<BR>परिपुष्ट, विपुष्ट.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=322" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

