1 पू पुना॑ति पुनीते॑ प॑वते (˚ति), pp. पूत॑ (q.v.)<BR>cleanse, purify, make clear or bright, sift, discern;<BR> contrive, invent,<BR>compose;<BR> M. also clear itself, flow clear;<BR> grow or be pure (lit. &<BR>fig.). C. पव॑यति or पाव॑यति purify. — अति purify, strain<BR>over or through (acc.);<BR> M. pass through (the body). अभि M. clear<BR>itself, flow clear towards or for (acc.). आ M. flow clear towards<BR>(acc.) or in (loc.), bestow by flowing (also A.). उद् cleanse, purify.<BR>निस् winnow. परा clear off. परि strain, filter, purify;<BR> M. flow<BR>off clear. वि cleanse thoroughly. सम् cleanse, purify;<BR> C. the same.<BR>— Cf. नि॑पूत, परिपूत.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=323" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

