पूज् पूजयति पूजय˚ते pp. पूजित (q.v.) reverence,<BR>worship, honour, present with (instr.);<BR> respect, regard. —अभि<BR>receive or greet reverentially, honour or present with (instr.), praise,<BR>celebrate. परि esteem highly. प्र honour, praise, esteem, present<BR>with (instr.). प्रति honour (in turn), salute respectfully, esteem,<BR>present with (instr.), praise, extol. सम् do honour to, salute<BR>respectfully, praise, celebrate, esteem, present with (instr.). — Cf.<BR>अभिपूजित.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=323" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

