पृच्
1 पृच् पृण॑क्ति पृङ्क्ते॑ etc., pp. पृक्त॑ (q.v.) mix,<BR>mingle, unite or combine with (instr., r. loc.);<BR> fill, satiate;<BR> bestow<BR>richly, lavish upon (loc.);<BR> augment, increase. —आ mix or unite with<BR>(instr.);<BR> fill, satiate (M. refl.);<BR> pervade, penetrate. उप add to<BR>(loc.), increase, augment;<BR> approach, esp. for sexual intercourse. वि<BR>bring asunder, separate from (instr.);<BR> scatter, disperse, fill, satiate.<BR>सम् A.M. mix, mingle, join, touch;<BR> fill, endow, present with (instr.).<BR>— Cf. अनुपृक्त, स॑पृक्त.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=326" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

