प्रत्यानयन n. leading or bringing back.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=339" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यायन|प्रत्यायनं
1 प्रत्यायन n. setting (of the sun).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=339" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यायन|प्रत्यायनं
