प्रत्युत्थान|प्रत्युत्थानं
प्रत्युत्थान n. rising up to meet (as friend or foe),<BR>esp. respectful reception.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=339" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युत्पन्न|प्रत्युत्पन्नः
प्रत्युत्पन्न a. present;<BR> ˚मति a. having presence<BR>of mind;<BR> m. Ready-wit, N. of a fish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=339" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युदाहरण|प्रत्युदाहरणं
