प्रत्युपपन्न
प्रत्युपपन्न a. present;<BR> ˚मति a. having presence<BR>of mind;<BR> abstr. ˚त्व n.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=339" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

