प्रत्यूह|प्रत्यूहः
प्रत्यूह m. obstacle, impediment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=339" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

