प्रत्यृतु
प्रत्यृतु adv. in each season.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=339" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्येक|प्रत्येकं
