प्रथमजा
प्रथम˚जा॑ a. firstborn, primary, original.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=339" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रथमजात
प्रथमजात a. firstborn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=339" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रथमतस्
प्रथमतस् adv. first, at first;<BR> forthwith,<BR>immediately;<BR> before, rather than (gen. or —˚).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=339" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रथमभक्ति
प्रथमभक्ति f. the former devotion.*<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=339" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रथमवयस्
प्रथमवयस् n. earliest age, youth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=339" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रथमश्री
प्रथमश्री a. having just become rich or fortunate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=339" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

