प्रथस्
प्र॑थस् n. प्रथिम॑न् m. width, extension.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=339" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रथित|प्रथितः
