प्रथिष्ठ|प्रथिष्ठः
प्र॑थिष्ठ superl. & comp. to पृथु॑.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=339" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रथीयंस्
प्र॑थीयंस् superl. & comp. to पृथु॑.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=339" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रद|प्रदः
प्रद a. giving, uttering, causing (mostly —˚).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=339" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदक्षिण|प्रदक्षिणं|प्रदक्षिणः
प्रदक्षिण a. standing on or moving to the right,<BR>turning the right towards a person,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=340" target="_blank">Page340</a>]<BR>i.e. respectful, reverential;<BR>°— & n. ˚ण॑म् adv., the latter also = towards the south. Acc. w. कृ<BR>or ˚णी कृ turn the right side towards a person or an object. m., n., &<BR>f. आ as abstr., also circumambulation from left to right.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=339" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदक्षिणार्चिस्
प्रदक्षिणार्चिस् a. flaming towards the right.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=340" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदक्षिणित्
प्रदक्षिणि॑त्^1 adv. = प्रदक्षिण adv.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20160412. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/CORRECTIONS/issues/275.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=340" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदक्षिणीकृ
प्रदक्षिणी@कृ v. प्रदक्षिण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=340" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदर|प्रदरः
प्रदर॑ m. splitting, rending;<BR> crack, crevice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=340" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदर्श|प्रदर्शः
प्रदर्श m. look (—˚);<BR> direction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=340" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदर्शक|प्रदर्शकः
प्रदर्शक a. showing, announcing, teaching;<BR> m.<BR>teacher.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=340" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदर्शन|प्रदर्शनं
प्रदर्शन n. look, aspect (often a. —˚);<BR> showing,<BR>pointing out;<BR> instruction, lesson.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=340" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदर्शिन्
प्रदर्शिन् a. looking, seeing;<BR> showing, indicating (—˚).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=340" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदातृ
प्रदातृ॑ m. giver, bestower, granter, esp. who gives a<BR>daughter in marriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=340" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदान|प्रदानं
प्रदा॑न n. giving, esp. in marriage, presenting,<BR>offering, yielding, granting, applying;<BR> gift, donation, oblation;<BR>communicating, teaching, proclaiming;<BR> putting on, applying;<BR> effecting,<BR>producing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=340" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदाय|प्रदायं
प्रदाय n. gift, present.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=340" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदायक
प्रदायक a. giving, presenting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=340" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदायिन्
प्रदा˚यिन् a. giving, presenting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=340" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदाह|प्रदाहः
प्रदाह m. burning, heating;<BR> destruction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=340" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदिव्
1 प्रदि॑व् f. (nom. प्रद्यौ॑स्) the third or fifth of the<BR>heavens.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=340" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदिव्
