प्रसुत्
प्रसु॑त् a. flowing forth (from the press);<BR> f. continued<BR>pressing of Soma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=348" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसुत
