प्रसुप्त a. fallen asleep, sleeping, senseless, at rest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=348" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

