1 बन्दिन् m. praiser of a prince, bard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=358" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

