बाध्
बाध् बा॑धते (बा॑ध˚ति), pp. बाधित॑ oppress,<BR>torment, beset, hurt, injure, remove, annul. C. बाधयति oppress,<BR>vex, pain, fight. D. बीभत्सते feel aversion or loathing (abl.). I.<BR>बाबधे or बद्धधे॑ press heavily, confine, hem in. — अति<BR>afflict or distress hard (acc. or gen.). अप drive away, remove (also<BR>C.). D. have a loathing for (abl.). अभि press hard, pain, vex,<BR>obstruct. अव keep off. आ press against, torment, distress. उद्<BR>break forth. नि press down, hem in, beset. निस् keep off. परि keep<BR>off, exclude or prevent from (abl. or gen.), protect from (abl.);<BR> vex,<BR>harass, pain. प्र press forwards, urge on, further;<BR> drive back, repel,<BR>torment, afflict, molest, injure, abolish, undo. प्रति drive back,<BR>ward off, hem in, disturb, afflict. वि press or drive asunder, repel,<BR>afflict, pain, hurt, injure. सम् press together, oppress, afflict,<BR>torment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=362" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाध|बाधः
बाध॑ m. oppressor, tormentor;<BR> (also f. आ) oppression,<BR>annoyance (also बा॑ध), opposition, resistance, pain, distress,<BR>injury, damage, expulsion, removal, annulment, contradiction, absurdity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=362" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

