ब्रह्मदातृ
ब्रह्मदातृ a. = ब्रह्मद.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=368" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मदान
ब्रह्मदान n. the gift of the Veda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=368" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मदाय|ब्रह्मदायः
