ब्रह्मदाय|ब्रह्मदायः
2 ब्रह्मदाय m. the Veda as an heritage, ˚हर a.<BR>receiving it from (gen.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=368" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मदेय|ब्रह्मदेयः
