ब्रह्मनिष्ठ|ब्रह्मनिष्ठः
ब्रह्मनिष्ठ a. quite absorbed in (the contemplation<BR>of) the Absolute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=368" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मपथ
ब्रह्मपथ m. the way to Brahman (m. or n.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=368" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मपुत्र|ब्रह्मपुत्त्रः|ब्रह्मपुत्रः
