ब्रह्म˚प्री॑ a. loving devotion or the Veda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=368" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मभवन
ब्रह्मभवन n. the abode of Brahman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=368" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मभाग|ब्रह्मभागः
