ब्रह्मवनि
ब्रह्मव॑नि a. devoted to Brahmans.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=368" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मवन्त्|ब्रह्मवत्
ब्रह्मवन्त् a. possessed of sacred learning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=368" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मवर्चस|ब्रह्मवर्च्चस|ब्रह्मवर्च्चसं
