भक्ष्
भक्ष् भक्षति भक्ष˚ते older भक्ष॑यति,<BR>भक्ष॑य˚ते, pp. भक्षित॑ (q.v.) partake of, enjoy, eat, drink,<BR>devour, consume, waste, destroy. C. भक्ष॑यति *cause a pers. (instr.<BR>or acc.) to eat (acc.);<BR> cf. also S. D. बिभक्षिषति & बिभक्षयिषति<BR>wish to eat or devour. — परि enjoy or drink (esp. what belongs to<BR>another), eat, feed on. सम् enjoy or devour (together).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=371" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

