भञ्ज्|भंज्
भञ्ज् भन॑क्ति pp. भग्न (q.v.) break, bend,<BR>curve;<BR> scatter, disperse;<BR> defeat, conquer;<BR> frustrate, disappoint,<BR>destroy, annihilate;<BR> P. भज्यते with intr. mg. (C. भञ्जयति w.<BR>शूले pierce with a pale*). — अभि break, destroy. अव break down<BR>(tr.). निस् break asunder, split. प्र break, destroy;<BR> rout, defeat<BR>(an army). वि break to pieces;<BR> scatter, distribute;<BR> frustrate,<BR>disappoint. सम् break, crush. — Cf. परिभग्न, संभग्न.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=372" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

