भाष्
भाष् भाषते (भाष˚ति), pp. भाषित (q.v.) speak,<BR>talk, say, tell (acc. of pers. & th.);<BR> name, call (2 acc.). C.<BR>भाषयति, ˚ते cause to speak;<BR> tell, say. — अनु call after or to<BR>(acc.), speak to or about (acc.);<BR> pronounce, confess. अप abuse,<BR>revile. अभि speak, say, tell (acc. of th. or - & - pers.), proclaim,<BR>confess. आ speak to, address (acc.), converse with (सह);<BR> say, tell<BR>(1 or 2 acc.);<BR> name, call;<BR> exclaim, promise. व्या & समा address, speak<BR>to, communicate. परि speak to, admonish, remind,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=378" target="_blank">Page378</a>]<BR>pronounce,<BR>explain, teach. प्र speak out, name, proclaim, communicate, expound,<BR>explain, converse with (acc.). प्रति speak back, answer (acc. of pers.<BR>or th.);<BR> relate, communicate. वि revile, abuse;<BR> P. admit an<BR>alternative, be optional (g.). सम् talk to, converse with (instr.<BR>±सह), address, salute, persuade. C. = S. — Cf. विभाषित.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाषक
