भी
1 भी भ॑यते बिभे॑ति (बिभ्यति), pp. भीत॑ (q.v.)<BR>fear, be afraid of (abl. or gen., r. instr. or acc.);<BR> fear for, be<BR>anxious about (abl.). C. भीष॑यते (˚ति) & भाययति frighten,<BR>terrify. — नि C put in fright. वि take fright. — Cf. प्रभीत,<BR>विभीत, संभीत.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=379" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

