भ्रष्ट|भ्रष्टं
भ्रष्ट॑ a. fallen, dropped down from (abl. or —˚) into<BR>(loc.);<BR> sunk, ruined, lost, gone;<BR> separated from, deprived of (abl. or<BR>—˚).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=387" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्रष्ट्र
भ्र॑ष्ट्र n. roasting pan.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=387" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

