मज्ज्
मज्ज् म॑ज्जति (म॑ज्ज˚ते), pp. मग्न (q.v.) sink (in<BR>water), dive, bathe, be submerged or drowned, be ruined, perish. C.<BR>मज्ज॑यति (˚ते) = S. trans. or act. — उद् emerge or plunge. C.<BR>cause to emerge or come up. उप sink, dive. नि sink down, plunge or<BR>penetrate into (loc.);<BR> disappear, perish;<BR> cause to sink or fall. C.<BR>cause to dive, drown. संनि sink down, fall. निस् sink;<BR> overflow.<BR>प्र & वि plunge, rush into (acc. or loc.). — Cf. आमग्न, उन्मग्न,<BR>निमग्न, संमग्न.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=389" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

