मिष्
मिष् मिष॑ति (मिष॑˚ते) open the eyes, look, behold (only<BR>the pres. pp. मिष॑न्त्, esp. in constructions as मिषतो<BR>बन्धुवर्गस्य before the eyes of the friends). — उद् = S. + blossom,<BR>expand. नि close the eyes, wink, fall asleep. — Cf. उन्मिषित.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=411" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मिष|मिषं|मिषः
