मिष्ट|मिष्टं|मिष्टः
मिष्ट a. savoury, dainty, sweet;<BR> n. = seq.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=411" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मिष्टान्न|मिष्टान्नं
