मिहिका f. snow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=412" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मिहिर|मिहिरः
मिहिर m. the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=412" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मी
मी मिना॑ति (मिनोति) damage, lessen, diminish;<BR> fail,<BR>transgress;<BR> frustrate, annul;<BR> M. P. मीय॑ते, मी॑यते perish, be lost.<BR>C. मापयति only with प्र (q.v.) — आ disturb, remove, annul,<BR>change, alter (M. intr., refl., or recipr.). उद् M. disappear. प्र<BR>frustrate, annul, destroy, annihilate;<BR> change, alter;<BR> transgress,<BR>neglect, miss, forget;<BR> outstrip, surpass. P. M. perish, die. C. destroy,<BR>kill;<BR> cause to be killed by (instr.). — Cf. प्रमीत.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=412" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मीडम्
मीडम् adv. softly, gently.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=412" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मीढ|मीढं|मीढः
