मूर्छ्
मूर्छ् मूर्छति pp. मूर्त॑ & मूर्छित (q.v.) become<BR>rigid, coagulate, thicken, increase, grow, sound loudly;<BR> become torpid<BR>or senseless, faint away, swoon. C. मूर्छयति (˚ते) cause to<BR>thicken;<BR> form, shape strengthen, augment, excite, rouse. — सम्<BR>thicken, coagulate, become firm or solid, sound loudly. C. stupefy,<BR>stun. — Cf. विमूर्छित, संमूर्छित.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मूर्छन
मूर्छन a. stunning;<BR> strengthening (—˚). n. increase,<BR>growth;<BR> f. आ fainting, swooning;<BR> swelling or rising of sounds,<BR>intonation, note, tone or semitone (in the scale), melody.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मूर्छा
मूर्छा f. thickening, coagulation;<BR> swoon, faint,<BR>stupefaction, astonishment;<BR> melody.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मूर्छित|मूर्च्छितः
मूर्छित a. rigid, stiff, thick, strong, intensive, full<BR>of, mixed with (—˚);<BR> roused, excited;<BR> stupefied, senseless;<BR> n. a kind<BR>of song.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मूर्त|मूर्त्त|मूर्त्तः
मूर्त॑ a. thickened, coagulated, solid, substantial,<BR>corporeal;<BR> stupefied, insensible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मूर्ति|मूर्तिः|मूर्त्ति|मूर्त्तिः
मू॑र्ति f. (firm) body, embodiment, form, shape, image,<BR>person, adj. —˚ formed of;<BR> pl. the solid parts of the body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मूर्तितस्
मूर्तितस् (abl. adv.) out of the body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मूर्तिमन्त्|मूर्तिमत्|मूर्त्तिमत्
मूर्तिमन्त् a. embodied, material, incarnate, personified;<BR>adj. —˚ formed of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मूर्ध
