मूर्धन्
मूर्ध॑न् m. forehead, scull, head, highest part, top,<BR>point, summit, chief, leader. मूर्ध्ना & मूर्ध्नि कृ put on the head<BR>i.e. esteem highly, w. धृ the same, w. वृत् stand above all.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मूर्धन्य|मूर्द्धन्यः
