मूलिन्
मूलि॑न् a. having a root.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=417" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मूल्य|मूल्यं
मूल्य a. being at the root. —n. original value, price,<BR>wages, pay, earnings, gain, capital.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=417" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मूष्
मू॑ष् s. mouse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=417" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मूष|मूषः
