म्लुच्
म्लुच् म्लोचति pp. म्लुक्त॑ go to rest. —अनु rise.<BR>उप retire to, hide behind (acc.). नि go down, set. अभिनि set<BR>upon (acc.). — Cf. अ॑पम्लुक्त (add.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=423" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

