यत्कृते adv. wherefore, why.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=425" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्न|यत्नः
यत्न m. endeavour, effort, labour, pains about (loc. or<BR>—˚). ˚—, instr., abl. & adv. in तस् with effort, diligently,<BR>carefully;<BR> यत्नं कृ take pains, strive after, endeavour at (loc. or<BR>infin.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=425" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्नवन्त्|यत्नवत्
यत्नवन्त् a. making effort, energetic, zealous about<BR>(loc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=425" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्प्रभाव
यत्प्रभाव a. of what power.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=425" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्र
य॑त्र adv. ( = loc. of य॑) where, when, while,<BR>as, if. — यत्र कुत्र (±अपि) wherever, everywhere. यत्र क्व च<BR>(±न) the same, at any time. यत्र क्वापि anywhere, here and there.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=425" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्रा
(य॑त्रा) adv. ( = loc. of य॑) where, when,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=426" target="_blank">Page426</a>]<BR>while,<BR>as, if. — यत्र कुत्र (±अपि) wherever, everywhere. यत्र क्व च<BR>(±न) the same, at any time. यत्र क्वापि anywhere, here and there.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=425" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्रत्य
यत्रत्य a. where being or dwelling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्रसायंगृह
यत्रसायंगृह a. resting where evening (comes).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्रेच्छक
यत्रेच्छक (˚—) where one likes, at pleasure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्रोद्भूत
यत्रोद्भूत a. where arisen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्संख्याक
यत्संख्याक^1 a. being in what number, counting how<BR>many.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20160418. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/CORRECTIONS/issues/289. note: cf. ccs, mw, pw.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथा
य॑था adv. as, in which way (correl. तथा, एव or<BR>एवम्), as truly as (corr. तथा), as for example (also तद्यथा).<BR>As conj. that (also before a direct quotation with इति), so that, in<BR>order that;<BR> as, since;<BR> as if. Often ˚— in adject. & adv., where<BR>sometimes not to be translated. — Cf. कथ॑म्, त॑था, & त॑द्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाकथित
यथाकथित a. (as) already mentioned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाकर्तव्य|यथाकर्त्तव्य
यथाकर्तव्य a. to be done under certain<BR>circumstances;<BR> n. the proper course of action.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाकर्म
यथाकर्म॑ adv. according to (the respective) actions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाकामम्
यथाका॑मम् (or ˚काम॑म्) adv. according to wish,<BR>agreeably, at one's ease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाकार्य
यथाकार्य a. = यथाकर्तव्य adj.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाकालम्
यथाकालम् adv. according to time, in due time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाकृत
यथाकृत a. well done, agreed;<BR> n. ˚कृत॑म् adv. as has<BR>been done, as usually, as agreed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाक्रमम्
यथाक्रमम् adv. according to order, in regular<BR>series.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाखेलम्
यथाखेलम् adv. with playful or gentle motion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथागत
यथागत a. (n. & instr. adv.) on which (way) one came<BR>before.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथागमनम्
यथागमनम् adv. as it has been got or found (of a<BR>ring, lit. according to its arrival).*<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाङ्गम्
यथाङ्ग॑म् adv. limb after limb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाचित्तम्
यथाचित्तम् adv. according to a person's thought or<BR>will.*<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाचिन्तितानुभाविन्
यथाचिन्तितानुभाविन् a. judging by one's own<BR>frame of mind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाज्ञानम्
यथाज्ञानम् adv. according to (the best of one's)<BR>knowledge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाज्येष्ठम्
यथाज्येष्ठम् adv. according to age or rank.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथातत्त्व
यथातत्त्व (˚—) & n. adv. according to truth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथातथम्
यथातथम् adv. as it really is, exactly, accurately,<BR>duly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथातथ्यम्
यथातथ्यम् adv. in accordance with the truth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथादर्शितम्
यथादर्शितम् adv. as shown.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

