यथादिक् adv. according to the various quarters of the<BR>sky.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथादिशम्
यथा˚दिशम् adv. according to the various quarters of<BR>the sky.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथादृष्टम्
यथादृष्टम् adv. as seen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

