यथादेवत॑म् adv. deity after deity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथादेशम्
1 यथादेशम् adv. according to places.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथादेशम्
2 यथादेशम् adv. according to direction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

