यथाभिप्रेत a. as wished or desired;<BR> n. adv.<BR>according to wish, at pleasure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाभिमत
यथाभिमत a. & adv. = prec. (also ˚—).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाभिरुचित
यथाभिरुचित a. as wished for, agreeable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाभिलषित
यथाभिलषित a. the same.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाभीष्ट
यथाभीष्ट a. the same.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाभ्यर्थित
