यथामति
यथामति adv. according to one's opinion or judgment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथामुख्य
यथामुख्य a. according to the chief or first,<BR>according to rank and dignity;<BR> n. adv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाम्नातम्
यथाम्नातम् adv. according to text or tradition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाम्नायम्
यथाम्नात˚म्नायम् adv. according to text or<BR>tradition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथायतनम्
यथायतन॑म् adv. according to place, in the right<BR>place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथायथम्
