यथारूप
यथारूप a. of which kind or sort;<BR> n. ˚प॑म् adv. in a<BR>suitable way, properly, duly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथार्थ|यथार्थं
यथार्थ a. accordant with the thing or fact, true,<BR>exact, proper, fit;<BR> ˚— & ˚र्थ॑म् adv., n. also as subst. the pure<BR>truth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथार्थनामक
यथार्थनामक a. having a true name.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथार्थनामन्
यथार्थनामन् n. a true name;<BR> a. = prec.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथार्थित
