यथालाभ (˚—) & ˚भम् adv. just as it happens to<BR>occur;<BR> justly, accidentally.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथालिखितानुभाविन्
