यथावीर्य a. of what strength;<BR> n. adv. according to<BR>strength or courage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

