यथासमयम् adv. according to time or circumstances.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथासमर्थितम्
यथासमर्थितम् adv. as settled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

