यथासुखम् adv. at ease or pleasure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथासुखमुख
यथासुखमुख a. turning the face as one<BR>pleases.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथास्थान
1 यथास्थान n. the right or proper place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथास्थान
2 यथास्थान a. ˚न॑म् adv. (being) in the proper<BR>place or in regular order.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथास्व|यथास्वं
यथास्व a. each his own;<BR> n. each in his own way.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाहार
यथाहार a. eating as opportunity offers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथेच्छ
यथेच्छ a. according to wish or desire;<BR> ˚—, n., &<BR>˚च्छया adv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथेप्सया
यथेप्सया (instr. adv.) = prec. adv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथेप्सित|यथेप्सितं
यथेप्सित a. & n. adv. = यथेच्छ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथेष्ट|यथेष्टं
यथेष्ट a. & n. adv. = यथेच्छ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथेष्टसंचारिन्
यथेष्टसंचारिन् a. going according to will or<BR>inclination.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथेष्टाचरण|यथेष्टाचरणः
यथेष्टाचरण n. arbitrary proceeding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथोक्त
यथोक्त a. as aforesaid or mentioned above;<BR> n. adv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथोक्तकारिन्
यथोक्तकारिन् a. acting as told or directed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथोचित|यथोचितं
यथोचित a. fit, proper, suitable, becoming;<BR> n. adv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथोत्तर
यथोत्तर a. following in regular succession;<BR> n. adv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथोत्साहम्
यथोत्साहम् adv. according to power, with all one's<BR>might.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथोदित|यथोदितं
यथोदित a. as said or spoken, previously told;<BR> n. adv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथोद्दिष्ट
यथोद्दिष्ट a. as indicated or mentioned, n. adv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथोपपत्ति
यथोपपत्ति adv. according to occasion, as may<BR>happen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथोप्त
यथोप्त a. as sown, answering to the seed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यद्
य॑द् n. sg. of य॑ (used also as stem ˚—);<BR> as conj. that<BR>(after such verbs as say, think, etc.), in order that, as for the fact<BR>that;<BR> when, if;<BR> wherefore, why;<BR> as, because, since. Often correl. to<BR>त॑द् q.v. — अ॑ध य॑द् & यदपि although, however;<BR> यद्वा or else;<BR>however, nevertheless;<BR> यत्सत्यम् certainly, indeed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदर्थ
यदर्थ a. having which object or intention.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदर्थम्
यदर्थम् a. for which purpose, wherefore.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदर्थे
यद˚र्थे a. for which purpose, wherefore.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदा
यदा॑ conj. when, if;<BR> often strengthened by एव<BR>(यदैव). In the correl. clause esp. अथ, तद्, तदा, तेन, etc. —<BR>यदा॑ कदा॑ च, यदा यदा or यदा w. doubled verb = whenever;<BR> यदा<BR>कदा चिद् at every time, always.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदि
य॑दि conj. if, when (also यदि चिद्, यदि चेद्, य॑दीद्,<BR>य॑द्यु, in the correl. clause often followed by अथ, तद्, तदा,<BR>ततस्, तर्हि, तेन, etc.);<BR> that, but (after a neg.);<BR> if not, perhaps<BR>that;<BR> how if? — तद्यपि or अपि यदि — (तथापि or तदपि) =<BR>although, however — (still, nevertheless). यदि (वा) — यदि (वा)<BR>whether — or;<BR> यदि—न वा whether — or not.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदी
(य॑दी) conj. if, when (also यदि चिद्, यदि चेद्, य॑दीद्,<BR>य॑द्यु, in the correl. clause often followed by अथ, तद्, तदा,<BR>ततस्, तर्हि, तेन, etc.);<BR> that, but (after a neg.);<BR> if not, perhaps<BR>that;<BR> how if? — तद्यपि or अपि यदि — (तथापि or तदपि) =<BR>although, however — (still, nevertheless). यदि (वा) — यदि (वा)<BR>whether — or;<BR> यदि—न वा whether — or not.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदीय|यदीयं
यदीय a. whose, belonging to whom, which, or what.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदु|यदुः
य॑दु m. N. of an ancient hero & his race;<BR> cf. तुर्व॑श.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदृच्छ
यदृच्छ a. accidental;<BR> f. आ accident, change, ˚—,<BR>instr., & ˚तस् accidentally, unexpectedly, spontaneously.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदृच्छालाभ
यदृच्छालाभ m. earning of what comes<BR>spontaneously;<BR> ˚तुष्ट a. satisfied with it.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यद्गोत्र
यद्गोत्र a. belonging to what family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यद्देवत
यद्देवत a. having which godhead or divinity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यद्धेतोस्
यद्धेतोस् (abl. adv.) from which reason or motive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यद्भविष्य
