यन्तृ|यंतृ
यन्तृ॑ m. holder, manager, driver, ruler.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्तव्य
यन्तव्य॑ a. to be held in or restrained.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्त्र|यंत्र|यंत्रं|यन्त्रं
