यन्त्रधारागृह
यन्त्रधारागृह n. a room with a shower-bath, a<BR>bathing-room;<BR> abstr. ˚त्व n.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्त्रय्
