यस्
यस् य॑स्यति ययस्ति pp. यस्त॑ be hot or eager, exert<BR>one's self. — आ = S., C. आयासयति strain, stretch, tire, vex,<BR>harass (w. आत्मानम् refl.*). प्र commence to boil up or be agitated,<BR>be hot or eager. — Cf. आयस्त (add.), प्र॑यस्त.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=430" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

