याचितव्य
याचितव्य a. to be asked (also for a girl).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=431" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याचितृ
