याच्य|याच्यं
याच्य a. to be asked or solicited;<BR> to be wooed, abstr. ˚ता<BR>f.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=431" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

