यु
1 यु यौ॑ति युते॑ युव॑ति युव॑˚ते॑ pp. युत॑ (q.v.)<BR>fasten, hold fast, bind, harness, join, unite, draw towards one's self,<BR>attract get possession of. D. यु॑यूषति wish to attract or hold fast.<BR>— आ draw onwards or towards, seize, occupy, get, procure, mix,<BR>mingle. पर्या & समा mix, stir up. नि tie on, fasten;<BR> procure,<BR>bestow;<BR> take to one's self, appropriate. प्र stir up, mix;<BR> disturb,<BR>destroy. सम् take to one's self, consume;<BR> put together, join, connect;<BR>share with, bestow on (instr.). — Cf. अभियुत, आयुत, नि॑युत,<BR>सं॑युत, समायुत.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=433" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यु
