यु
3 यु युयो॑ति यु॑च्छति युयो॑ति यु॑च्छ˚ते pp. युत<BR>tr. repel, keep or ward off, separate, protect from (abl.);<BR> intr. keep<BR>apart, be or remain separate. C. यव॑यति or याव॑यति = S. tr. I.<BR>pp. यो॑युवत् yield, give way. — अप remove, avert from (abl. or<BR>dat.). निस् keep off, repel. प्र remove;<BR> keep away (intr.), be<BR>indolent or heedless. वि part (tr. & intr.);<BR> separate or be separated<BR>from, deprive or be deprived of (instr.);<BR> scatter, disperse, open. —<BR>Cf. वि॑युत.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=433" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

