युध्
1 युध् यु॑ध्यते यु॑ध्य˚ति योधति pp. युद्ध॑<BR>(q.v.) fight, combat, contend with (instr. ±सह or समम्) for or<BR>about (loc.);<BR> fight (tr. w. acc.), vanquish. C. योध॑यति, ˚ते<BR>cause to fight, fight (tr.), defend. D.<BR>यु॑युत्सति, ˚ते wish to fight with (instr. or acc.). — अभि fight<BR>(acc. or instr.), vanquish, win by fighting. आ fight (tr.). उद् rise<BR>against (dat.). नि fight with (सह or साकम्). प्र (begin to)<BR>fight, attack (acc.). C. cause to open the fight. मंप्र (begin to)<BR>fight. प्रति fight against, vanquish, be a match for (acc.). C. the<BR>same. सम् fight together, fight with (acc. or instr. ±सार्धम्). —<BR>Cf. प्रयुद्ध, प्रतियुद्ध.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=435" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युध्
