यूथिका f. a kind of jasmine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=436" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूथ्य
यूथ्य॑ a. belonging to a herd or troop;<BR> f. आ herd,<BR>flock, troop.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=436" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यून
यून n. band, cord, string.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=436" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूप|यूपः
यू॑प m. post, esp. the stake to which the sacrificial victim<BR>is fastened, poss. ˚वन्त्†.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=436" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूपाहुति|यूपाहुतिः
यूपाहुति f. offering at the erection of the sacrificial<BR>post.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=436" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूयुवि
यू॑युवि a. removing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=436" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूष|यूषं|यूषः
यूष m. n. broth, soup.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=436" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूषन्
यूष॑न् (only weak cases) & यू॑स् (only nom.) = prec.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=436" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

