योगक्षेमकर a. causing welfare.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=436" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगधर्मिन्
योगधर्मिन् a. devoted to meditation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=436" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगधारणा
योगधारणा f. perseverance in devotion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=436" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगनिद्रा
योगनिद्रा f. contemplative sleep, i.e. a state<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=437" target="_blank">Page437</a>]<BR>between sleeping and waking, slumber, esp. that of Viṣṇu at the end of<BR>an age of the world.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=436" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगभ्रष्ट
योगभ्रष्ट a. fallen from devotion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=437" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगमाया
योगमाया f. magic, charm, spell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=437" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगयज्ञ
योगयज्ञ m. the sacrifice of devotion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=437" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगयात्रा
योगयात्रा f. the way of meditation, T. of a work.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=437" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगयुक्त
योगयुक्त a. sunk in meditation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=437" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगरोचना
योगरोचना f. a cert. magical ointment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=437" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगवन्त्|योगवत्
योगवन्त् a. joined, united;<BR> adhering to the Yoga system.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=437" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगविद्
