योगात्मन्
योगात्मन् a. whose essence or nature is devotion or the<BR>Yoga system.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=437" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगायोग
योगायोग m. du. propriety or impropriety.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=437" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगिता
योगिता f. ˚त्व n. abstr. to seq. adj. (—˚);<BR> n. also<BR>abstr. to seq. m.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=437" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगिन्
