योज्य
योज्य a. turned to (loc.), to be appointed or compelled to<BR>(loc. or —˚);<BR> to be used or employed, to be added to (loc.) or<BR>furnished with (instr.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=437" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योत्र|योत्रं
