योद्धुकाम
योद्धुकाम a. wishing to fight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=437" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योद्धृ
योद्धृ m. fighter, warrior.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=437" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योध|योधः
