योधनीय
योधनीय a. to be fought.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=437" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योधमुख्य|योधमुख्यः
योधमुख्य m. chief in war, leader.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=437" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योधवीर
योधवीर m. hero (in war).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=437" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योधिन्
योधिन् a. fighting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=437" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योधीयंस्
