योध्य
यो॑ध्य a. to be fought.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=437" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योनि|योनिः
