रक्ष्
रक्ष् र॑क्षति र॑क्ष˚ते pp. रक्षित॑ protect, guard,<BR>keep, save from (abl.), take care of (acc.);<BR> beware of, prevent (acc.).<BR>C. रक्षयति protect from (abl.), save. D. रिरक्षति wish to protect<BR>from (abl.). —अनु guard or protect (by following). अभि & समभि<BR>keep, protect. आ protect, guard from (abl.). परि keep, guard,<BR>watch, protect, save from (abl.), take care of, maintain, observe. प्र<BR>preserve, rescue or deliver from (abl.). प्रति keep, observe. वि the<BR>same. सम् guard, watch, keep, maintain, take care of, defend, save.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=438" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

