रन्
1 रन् र॑णति र॑ण˚ते & रण्यति be pleased, rejoice,<BR>take pleasure in (loc., r. acc.). C. रण॑यति, ˚ते delight a pers.<BR>with (instr.) or in (loc.), or = S. (w. loc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=443" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रन्
