रन्ध्रोपनिपातिन्
रन्ध्रोपनिपातिन् a. rushing in through holes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=443" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रप्
रप् र॑पति chatter, whisper;<BR> I. रारपीति = S.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=443" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रपस्
र॑पस् n. defect, fault, hurt, injury.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=443" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रप्श्
†रप्श् रप्शते (S. only in seq.) be full. — प्र reach<BR>beyond (abl.). वि be overfull, have plenty of (gen. or instr.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=443" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रप्शदूधन्
रप्श॑दूधन् a. having a full udder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=443" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रफ्
