राज्
1 राज् रा॑जति रा॑ज˚ते रा॑ष्टि reign, rule, direct, be<BR>master of (gen.);<BR> shine, glitter, be illustrious or eminent, distinguish<BR>one's self, appear as (इव). C. राजयति, ˚ते rule, govern. — अनु<BR>imitate. निस् C. cause to shine or glitter. परि shine all around.<BR>वि = S. +excel, surpass (abl.). अतिवि shine very bright. अनुवि<BR>follow (acc.). सम् reign, rule (gen.). — Cf. इरज्य्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=446" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

