रि
रि री, रिणा॑ति, रिणीते, रीयते, pp. रीण A. let loose,<BR>sever from (abl.);<BR> cause to run or stream, emit, grant, bestow;<BR> M. flow,<BR>run, dissolve. —अनु M. flow after (acc.). आ A. cause to run;<BR> M.<BR>run. नि loosen, unveil, tear asunder, destroy. निस् sever from<BR>(abl.). वि hew asunder, cleave. सम् put together, restore.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=449" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

