1 रिप् only pp. रिप्त॑ smear, stick, cleave to;<BR> cheat, impose<BR>upon (only रिरिपु॑स्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=450" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिप्
2 रि॑प् f. cheat (abstr. & concr.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=450" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

