रिह्
रिह् रे॑ढि pp. रीढ lick, caress, kiss. I.<BR>रेरिह्य॑ते, pp. रेरिहत् & रे॑रिहाण lick repeatedly, kiss. — आ<BR>lick, gnaw at (acc.). परि & प्रति the same. सम् lick together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=450" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

