रु|रुः
1 रु रौति रुव॑ति रवति रवते pp. रुत॑ (q.v.)<BR>roar, howl, shriek, croak, sound, thunder. C. रावयति cause to roar<BR>or cry, fill with cries. I. रोरवीति, रोरूयते, ˚ति roar or cry out<BR>loudly. — अभि & आ roar etc. (at or against). प्र roar or cry<BR>aloud. वि roar, yelp, shout, creak, rattle, tinkle;<BR> cry or call at. C.<BR>cry aloud, make resound. — Cf. अभिरुत, विरुत.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=450" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रु|रुः
