रुंष्
रुंष् pp. रुंषित covered with dust, smeared, soiled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=450" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

