रुक्मस्तेय n. stealing gold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=450" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुक्माभ
रुक्माभ a. bright like gold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=451" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

