रुक्मिन्
रुक्यि॑न् a. having golden ornaments. — m. N. of an ancient<BR>hero, f. रुक्भिणी his sister, Kṛṣṇa's wife.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=451" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

