रुच्य|रुच्यं|रुच्यः
रुच्य a. splendid, beautiful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=451" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुज्
1 रुज् रुज॑ति pp. रुग्ण॑ (q.v.) break, crush down,<BR>destroy;<BR> pain, afflict. C. रोजयति give one a blow upon (loc.).<BR>—अव break off. आ break open or asunder, tear out, lacerate, dislimb.<BR>प्र break to pieces. वि & सम् break, crush, rend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=451" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुज्
