रुत|रुतं
2 रुत॑ a. broken down, ill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=451" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुतज्ञ|रुतज्ञः
रुतज्ञ a. knowing the language (of beasts and birds);<BR> m.<BR>an augur.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=451" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुतवेत्तृ
रुतवेत्तृ m. & रुताभिज्ञ a. = prec. m. & a.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=451" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुद्
रुद् रोदिति रुदति रोदिति रुद˚ते रोदति रोद˚ते<BR>pp. रुदित (q.v.) cry, weep, lament. C. रोद॑यति cause to weep or<BR>lament. I. रोरुद्यते weep very much. — अनु weep after or for<BR>(acc.). प्र burst into tears, begin to weep or lament;<BR> cry aloud;<BR> weep<BR>with (acc.). वि weep or cry aloud, sob.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=451" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुदित|रुदितं
