रुद्रजापिन्
रुद्र˚जापिन् a. reciting the Rudrajapa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=451" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुद्रदेव
