लङ्घ्|लंघ्
लङ्घ् लङ्घति लङ्घ˚ते leap;<BR> mostly C. लङ्घयति<BR>(˚ते), pp. लङ्घित spring over, go beyond (acc.);<BR> travel over<BR>(अध्वानम्);<BR> mount, ascend, enter;<BR> get off, escape;<BR> overstep,<BR>transgress;<BR> violate, offend;<BR> excel, surpass, outstrip. — अति C.<BR>transgress. अभि C. leap or step over, transgress, offend. उद् C. the<BR>same + pass by, escape;<BR> pass or travel over (way). वि C. leap over,<BR>pass by;<BR> transgress, violate;<BR> neglect, omit;<BR> surpass, excel;<BR> wrong,<BR>offend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=458" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

