लिप्त॑ a. smeared, stained, soiled, defiled;<BR> cleaving or<BR>sticking to (loc.);<BR> f. आ minute (1/60 degree).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=462" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

