लिप्सु|लिप्सुः
लिप्सु a. wishing to get, longing for (acc. or —˚).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=462" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिबुजा
