वञ्च्|वंच्
वञ्च् व॑ञ्चति totter, go crookedly, sneak;<BR> P. वच्य॑ते<BR>move to and fro (lit. & fig.), rock, roll, hurry along. C. वञ्चयति,<BR>˚ते, pp. वञ्चित (q.v.) mislead, deceive, cheat of (instr. or abl.),<BR>escape. — अच्छ roll or move towards (acc.). अभि C. deceive,<BR>cheat. आ P. roll or spring forth. उप C. & निस् M. deceive, cheat.<BR>परि sneak about;<BR> C. cheat. प्र C. escape. सम् totter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=469" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

