वध्
वध् (वधति) P. वध्यते (˚जि) strike, slay, kill,<BR>destroy. C. वधयति = S. — अप cut off, cleave;<BR> drive away. अभि<BR>& समभि smite upon (acc.). आ crush down, dash to pieces. उद् tear<BR>out or in pieces. उप strike on (acc.), slay, kill. नि fix or fasten<BR>in (loc.);<BR> knock down, kill. निस् frustrate, annihilate. परा cleave,<BR>tear asunder. प्र beat. वि destroy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=470" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

