वप्
1 वप् व॑पति व॑प˚ते pp. उप्त shear, shave (hair or<BR>beard, M. refl.), trim (nails);<BR> shear fig. = crop off, graze. C.<BR>वापयति, ˚ते cause to shear or to be shorn (M. refl.). — परि<BR>shear around. प्र shear off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=473" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वप्
2 वप् व॑पति व॑प˚ते pp. उप्त॑ (q.v.) strew, scatter,<BR>esp. seed, sow;<BR> throw or cast (dice etc.). C. वापयति sow, plant.<BR>—अनु bestrew;<BR> scatter, disperse. अप disperse, destroy. अपि & अभि<BR>bestrew, cover. आ strew or throw upon, mix, mingle, pour out. C. mix,<BR>add, arrange, comb (the hair). उद् draw out, dig up, raise;<BR> cast away.<BR>उप heap up, bestrew, inter, cover. नि heap up, raise, sow upon<BR>(loc.);<BR> throw down, cast (dice). निस् throw or draw out, deal out (from<BR>a larger mass), distribute;<BR> present an oblation to a god, offer. C.<BR>scatter, sow, deal out. परा throw aside, remove. परि bestrew with<BR>(instr.). प्र scatter, pour out, throw upon or in (loc.), bestrew.<BR>प्रति infix, insert;<BR> stick or set with (instr.);<BR> join, add. सम् pour<BR>in, mingle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=473" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

