वहनीय
वहनीय a. to be carried, drawn, or borne.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=481" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वहन्ती
