वा
1 वा (indecl.) or (following its word), either — or not, i.e.<BR>optionally (g.), as, like ( = इव), indeed, even ( = एव), but, but<BR>if, suppose that (fut.), possibly (after an interr.), often only explet.<BR>— वा — वा either — or;<BR> वा — न वा either — or not, perhaps —<BR>perhaps not,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=482" target="_blank">Page482</a>]<BR>whether — or not;<BR> वा न — वा either not — or;<BR>यदि वा — वा (न) whether — or (not). न (±वा) — वा neither<BR>— nor. — Cf. अ॑थ, उत॑, कि॑म्, य॑दि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=481" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वा
2 वा व॑यति व॑य˚ते pp. उत॑ or ऊत weave,<BR>interweave, plait, fig.<BR>= compose (hymns etc.). — आ weave or lay in, interweave;<BR> also =<BR>समा M. string upon (loc.). उद् bind up, suspend. परि interweave;<BR>tie round, fetter, ensnare. प्र weave or tie to (loc.). वि plait,<BR>twist, weave. सम् weave together, interweave, inlay or adorn with<BR>(instr.). — Cf. ओ॑त, प्रोत, व्यु॑त, व्यूत, समुत॑.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=482" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वा
3 वा वा॑ति वा॑यति वा॑ति वा॑य˚ते pp. वात॑ & वान<BR>(—˚) blow, blow near or towards (tr. & intr.), spread (intr. of<BR>odours), smell. — अनु blow towards or after (acc.), inflame, rouse.<BR>अभि & आ blow towards or hither. अव blow down. उप cease to blow,<BR>be extinguished. निस् blow, also = prec. C. निर्वापयति extinguish,<BR>allay, refresh, delight. परा blow away. प्र blow, be exhaled or<BR>spread (odour). वि blow asunder or through. सम् blow. — Cf.<BR>निर्वाण, प्रवात॑.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=482" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वा
4 वा v. 1 वन्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=482" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वा
5 वा॑ before उ = वै॑.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=482" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

