1 विज् विज॑ते (˚ति & वेजते), pp. विग्न (विक्त) dart<BR>up or back (intr.), tremble, flee from (abl.). C. वेजयति dart (tr.),<BR>frighten, agitate;<BR> strengthen, increase. I. वे॑विज्यते start up at<BR>(dat.), flee from (abl.). — उद् start up, take a fright, be afraid of<BR>(abl., gen., or instr.);<BR> get tired of or disgusted with, desist from<BR>(abl.). C. terrify, frighten, vex, annoy, harass. समुद् start for<BR>fear, take fright. प्र rush away. वि C. frighten. सम् start up,<BR>run away, fall asunder. — Cf. आविग्न, उद्विग्न, प्र॑विक्त, विविग्न,<BR>संविग्न, समाविग्न, समुद्विग्न.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=492" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

