वृत्तवन्त्|वृत्तवत्
वृत्तवन्त् a. round;<BR> also = seq.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=519" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

