वृत्तसंपन्न|वृत्तसम्पन्न
वृत्त˚संपन्न^1 a. well behaved, virtuous.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20160418. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/CORRECTIONS/issues/289. note: cf ccs, mw, pw.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=519" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

