वेष्ट्
वेष्ट् वे॑ष्टते wind around (intr.), cling or stick to<BR>(loc.). C. वेष्ट॑यति, ˚ते, pp. वेष्टित॑ wind or tie round;<BR> wrap,<BR>envelop, cover, enclose, surround. — अनु C. wrap, cover;<BR> spread.<BR>अप C. strip off. अभि wrap, cover. आ spread or expand over<BR>(loc.);<BR> C. wrap, cover, clothe;<BR> twist (a string);<BR> enclose, confine. उद्<BR>unwind, unfasten, untwist, unseal. उप C. wind round, embrace. नि<BR>clutch, grasp, wrap. निस् strip off, bare. परि wind or put around;<BR>wrap, cover, enclose, surround. वि strip off;<BR> wrap, envelop. सम्<BR>roll or shrink together. C. wrap, envelop, cover;<BR> cause to roll or<BR>shrink together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=524" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

