व्यस्थक
व्यस्थक a. boneless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=529" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्या
व्या व्य॑यति व्य॑य˚ते pp. वीत॑ (q.v.) wrap, veil,<BR>envelop;<BR> M. refl. — अप unveil, uncover;<BR> M. extricate one's self i.e.<BR>deny. अपि cover. आ wrap round (acc.), hide one's self in (loc.).<BR>उप hang about (esp. the sacred cord over the left shoulder). नि<BR>wind or hang about. परि wrap around;<BR> M. wind something as cover round<BR>one's self. सम् A. roll up, envelop;<BR> veil in (instr.), M. refl. — Cf.<BR>उ॑पवीत, नि॑वीत, प॑रिवीत, संवीत.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=529" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याकरण|व्याकरणं
व्याकरण n. putting asunder, separation^1;<BR> explanation,<BR>manifestation;<BR> analysis, grammar.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by AnnaRybakovaT, Jim Funderburk. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=529" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

