शंस्
शंस् शं॑सति (शं॑स˚ते), pp. शस्त॑ (q.v.) &<BR>शंशित say in a loud and solemn voice, recite, praise, vow, unfold,<BR>betray, announce, communicate, declare, foretell, prophesy. C.<BR>शंसयति cause to recite;<BR> announce, foretell. — अति recite beyond<BR>(2 acc. or instr. & acc.);<BR> omit in reciting. अनु recite or praise<BR>(after another). अभि accuse, defame;<BR> praise, commend. आ M. (A.)<BR>hope or trust in, strive after (loc., acc., dat., or infin.), try to<BR>master (acc.), suppose, expect, fear;<BR> wish, desire (acc. or — & —<BR>infin.). beg for (acc.);<BR> praise, commend, recite, announce, foretell.<BR>समा A. adjudge to (dat.);<BR> M. hope or trust in (acc.). उद् call upon,<BR>invoke. प्र tell forth, proclaim aloud;<BR> stir up, excite;<BR> praise,<BR>extol, recommend to (gen.). वि recite, divide^1 in reciting. सम्<BR>recite (together). उपसम् recite in addition. — Cf. अभिशस्त,<BR>प्रशस्त॑.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by AnnaRybakovaT, Jim Funderburk. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=533" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शंस|शंसः
शं॑स m. solemn utterance, invocation, summons, vow,<BR>praise, blessing, curse;<BR> f. शंसा praise, eulogy, communication,<BR>message.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=533" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शंसथ
शंसथ m. conversation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=533" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शंसन|शंसनं
शंसन n. recitation, utterance, confession,<BR>communication.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=533" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शंसनीय
शंसनीय^1 a. to be praised.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20160412. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/CORRECTIONS/issues/275. note: alph. order, cf. MW, PW.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=533" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

