शक्
शक् शक्नो॑ति pp. शक्त (q.v.) & शकित be able, P.<BR>शक्यते impers. it is possible to (inf.) or pers. he is able to be, he<BR>can or may be (infin. w. pass. mg);<BR> be serviceable or helpful to (dat.),<BR>make another partake of (gen.). D. शिक्षति (q.v.). — अनु be equal<BR>in (acc.). आ assist (dat.), help a pers. (dat.) to (gen.), invite to<BR>(acc.). उप help, impart. परि master, overpower. प्र be able to<BR>(infin.). सम् be able to (infin.), w. न not be equal to or a match<BR>for (loc. or instr.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=533" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

