शप्
शप् श॑पति श॑प˚ते (शप्यति), pp. शप्त॑ (q.v.) &<BR>शपित curse, execrate, revile, scold, blame;<BR> M. (A.) curse one's self<BR>if, i.e. assert with an oath that not (यदि), swear by (instr.),<BR>conjure (acc. or dat.);<BR> implore, entreat for (acc.) by (instr.). C.<BR>शापयति cause to swear, conjure by (instr.). — अभि curse, blame,<BR>accuse;<BR> C. conjure. परि curse, blame, revile. प्रति curse in<BR>return. सम् curse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=537" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

