शिक्ष्
शिक्ष् शि॑क्षति शि॑क्ष˚ते pp. शिक्षित (q.v.) strive to<BR>be able, try, practise, learn (mostly M.);<BR> be willing to help (dat.), to<BR>give or impart (acc.), or to present with (instr.). C. शिक्षयति (˚ते)<BR>cause a person to learn a thing, teach, instruct (2 acc., or acc. of<BR>pers. & loc. of th. or infin.;<BR> also gen. of pers. & acc. of th.).<BR>—अनु learn, C. teach. अभि C. teach. आ cause to partake of (gen.),<BR>wish to present with (instr.). उग्र<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=546" target="_blank">Page546</a>]<BR>attract, entice, invite;<BR>try, practise, learn (mostly M.). प्रति allure, invite. वि<BR>distribute. सम् C. teach.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=545" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

