शिष्
शिष् शिन॑ष्टि शिंषति pp. शिष्ट॑ (q.v.) leave;<BR> P.<BR>शिष्यते be left, remain, w. न want, be missing. C. शेषयति, ˚ते<BR>leave, spare. — अति leave remaining;<BR> P. remain. अप leave out.<BR>अव leave remaining (also C.);<BR> P. be left, remain. ऊद् & परि the<BR>same. वि leave apart i.e. separate, distinguish, characterize. P. be<BR>distinguished by (instr.), differ from (abl.);<BR> be eminent among (gen. or<BR>loc.), be better or more excellent than (abl. or instr.). C.<BR>distinguish, characterize;<BR> pick out, prefer;<BR> exceed, surpass (acc.).<BR>प्रवि increase, augment. — Cf. अ॑तिशिष्ट, अवशिष्ट, उ॑च्छिष्ट,<BR>प॑रिशिष्ट (sic!), वि॑शिष्ट, स॑शिष्ट.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=548" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

