शुध्
शुध् शुन्ध्, pp. शुद्ध॑ (q.v.), शु॑न्धति, pp.<BR>शुद्ध॑ (q.v.), शु॑न्ध˚ते purify, M. mostly intr. or refl.;<BR>शु॑ध्यति (˚ते) become pure or clear, be justified or excused. C.<BR>शोध॑यति purify (also शुन्धयति);<BR> mend, correct;<BR> wash or clear<BR>off, remove (what is impure or noxious);<BR> pay back, restore;<BR> examine,<BR>try;<BR> acquit, justify;<BR> make clear, explain. — परि (शुध्यति, ˚ते)<BR>become pure or clean, clear or justify one's self. C. pay back, restore;<BR>examine, try, explain. वि (शुध्यति, ˚ते) become thoroughly clean or<BR>pure. C. clear, purify, purge, justify, mend, correct, improve. सम् C.<BR>cleanse, purify;<BR> pay back, restore;<BR> mend, improve. — Cf. परिशुद्ध,<BR>विशुद्ध, संशुद्ध.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=552" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

