श्रम्
श्रम् श्रा॑म्यति श्रमति श्रा॑म्यति श्रम˚ते pp.<BR>श्रान्त॑ (q.v.) be weary, take pains, exert or castigate one's self. C.<BR>श्रमयति or श्रामयति weary, tire, bring down, subdue. — अभि<BR>weary, tire. उप rest, repose. परि take great pains, torment one's<BR>self. वि rest, recreate one's self;<BR> pause, cease;<BR> rely upon, trust in<BR>(loc.). C. cause to rest or repose;<BR> bring to rest i.e. appease, quench,<BR>finish. — Cf. परिविशान्त, परिशान्त, विशान्त, संशान्त.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=559" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

