श्री
3 श्री॑ (nom. श्री॑स्) f. beauty, splendour, ornament;<BR> comfort,<BR>satisfaction, welfare, bliss;<BR> wealth, treasure;<BR> high rank, glory,<BR>majesty, royalty & its insignia. Often personif. as the goddess of<BR>beauty, welfare, & royal splendour. Used also as honorific prefix to<BR>proper names = the famous, glorious, or mighty. — Du. श्रियौ beauty<BR>and welfare;<BR> dat. श्रिये॑ or श्रियौ॑ as infin. or adv. pleasantly,<BR>prettily, gloriously.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=561" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

