श्रु
श्रु श्रृणो॑ति श्रृणुते॑ pp. श्रुत॑ (q.v.) hear, learn<BR>(acc.) from (gen., abl., instr., & मुखात् or श्रकाशात्);<BR> hear — to<BR>be (2 acc.);<BR> listen or give ear to (acc. of th. or gen. of pers.);<BR> hear<BR>a teacher i.e. learn, study. M.P. be heard of, be known as or to be (2<BR>nom.);<BR> be studied, taught, or read. C. श्रव॑यति & शाव॑यति (˚ते)<BR>cause a person to hear, i.e. address, inform of, communicate to, tell<BR>(acc. of thing & acc., gen., or dat. of pers.);<BR> let hear i.e. proclaim,<BR>announce, recite. D. श्रु॑शूषते (˚ति) wish or like to hear i.e. attend<BR>to, obey, wait on, serve (acc.). — अति M. be heard of i.e. be<BR>celebrated above (all). अनु hear or learn (again);<BR> C. relate, tell (2<BR>acc.);<BR> D.M. obey. अभि hear, learn — to be (2 acc.). C. cause to<BR>hear, speak to, address (acc.). आ listen to (acc. of th., gen. or dat.<BR>of pers.);<BR> hear, learn;<BR> promise. C. proclaim, make known;<BR> address,<BR>invoke, summon. अभ्या C. address. उप listen to (acc. or gen.),<BR>hear, learn from (मुखात् or सकाशात्), hear that — is (2 acc.).<BR>समुप hear, listen to (acc. or gen.), learn from (abl.). परि hear,<BR>learn, understand that—is (2 acc.). प्र M. be heard;<BR> become known or<BR>famous. प्रति listen or give ear;<BR> say yes, promise. C. answer. वि<BR>hear, learn;<BR> P. be heard of, become known or famous. C. let hear,<BR>announce, proclaim, tell;<BR> make known or famous, make resound. सम् hear<BR>(मुखात्), listen<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=562" target="_blank">Page562</a>]<BR>to (acc.);<BR> accede to the request of, make a<BR>promise to (loc. or dat.). C. let hear, announce, proclaim;<BR> make<BR>resound. अभिसम् hear, learn. प्रतिसम् make a promise to (gen.). —<BR>Cf. अभिविशुत, अभिशुत॑, आशुत, परिशुत, वि॑शुत.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=561" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रुत्
श्रुत् (—˚) hearing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=562" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रुत|श्रुतं|श्रुतः
