सच्
सच् स॑चते (स॑च˚ति), सि॑षक्ति, स॑श्चचि<BR>(स॑श्चचि˚ते) be united, have intercourse with, deal with, be<BR>possessed of or obnoxious to (instr.);<BR> belong, be attached or devoted<BR>to, attend on, accompany, follow, pursue, visit (acc.);<BR> help to (dat.);<BR>stay or be in (loc.). — अनु go after, follow, pursue;<BR> stick to<BR>(acc.). अप withdraw, escape. अभि seek, turn towards (acc.). आ &<BR>उप seek, look for (acc.). नि be closely connected with (instr.)<BR>प्र pursue. प्रति pursue with vengeance. सम् be united or<BR>connected with (instr.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=576" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

