सत्य|सत्यं|सत्यः
सत्य॑ a. real, true, genuine;<BR> serious, valid, effective,<BR>sincere, faithful, honest, good. m. E. of Kṛṣṇa, N. of a genius etc.<BR>f. आ E. of Durgā, N. of a daughter of Dharma etc. n. the real or<BR>true, reality, truth;<BR> true character, sincerity, faithfulness;<BR> vow,<BR>promise, oath;<BR> also adv. really, truly, indeed, yes, very well;<BR> of<BR>course, it is true (also यत्सत्यम्)—yet (तु, किं तु or तथापि).<BR>Instr. सत्येन according to truth;<BR> तेन सत्येन (±यथा) as truly<BR>as this, by this truth, on this account or for this reason.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=580" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

