सू
1 सू सू॑ते सौति सुव॑ति सुव॑˚ते (सूयते सूय˚ति)<BR>pp. सूत॑ & सुत॑ (q.v.) generate, beget, bring forth, enliven,<BR>impel, set in motion. — अप sent or drive away. अभि consecrate for<BR>(acc.), endow with (instr.). आ hurt upon (dat.), send, bestow,<BR>procure. निस् & परा drive away, remove. प्र bring forth, produce,<BR>impel, set in motion, cause, bid. संप्र & सम् beget, bring forth,<BR>produce. — Cf. प्र॑सूत.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=630" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

