स्तम्भ्|स्तंभ्
स्तम्भ् स्तभ्, स्तभ्ना॑ति, स्तभ्नोति, स्तम्भते (˚ति),<BR>pp. स्तभित॑ & स्तब्ध (q.v.) prop, support, uphold, make firm or<BR>steady;<BR> M. become firm or rigid. C. स्तम्भाय॑ति & स्तम्भयति,<BR>स्तभ्ना॑ति, स्तभ्नोति, स्तम्भते (˚ति), pp. स्तभित॑ & स्तब्ध<BR>(q.v.) prop, support, uphold, make firm or steady;<BR> M. become firm or<BR>rigid. C. स्तम्भाय॑ति & स्तम्भय˚ते = S., the latter also = make<BR>stiff or lame, paralyze, stun, obstruct, suppress. — अव (ष्ट) fix,<BR>fasten, prop, support, intr. lean upon (acc.);<BR> seize, take prisoner,<BR>obstruct, shut up. पर्यव (ष्ट) surround. समव (ष्ट) raise up<BR>(fig.);<BR> lean upon (acc.). उद् (त्त) prop up, fix, establish. C. lift<BR>up, raise (lit. & fig.);<BR> excite, impel. उप erect, uphold, support.<BR>प्रति (ष्ट) hold against, M. intr. वि (ष्ट) fix, establish,<BR>raise (lit. & fig.), make firm, stiff, or immovable, stop, obstruct;<BR>lean upon (acc.).<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=639" target="_blank">Page639</a>]<BR>C. stop, hold back. सम् confirm, strengthen,<BR>make stiff or rigid, stop, suppress. C. the same. अभिसम्, परिसम् &<BR>प्रतिसम् confirm, strengthen. — Cf. अवष्टब्ध, उ॑त्तब्ध &<BR>उ॑त्तभित, प्र॑स्तब्ध, वि॑ष्टब्ध & वि॑ष्टभित, संस्तब्ध.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=638" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्तम्भ|स्तंभ|स्तंभः|स्तम्भः
