स्तुभ्
1 स्तुभ् स्तो॑भति (˚ते) utter a sound, shout, exult,<BR>warble, etc. — अनु follow in shouting. अभि add by shouting.<BR>व्यव separate by sounds. परि shout around. प्र incite by<BR>shouting. प्रति shout in return, re-echo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=639" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्तुभ्
2 स्तुभ् f. shout, exultation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=639" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

