स्पृश्
1 स्पृश् स्पृश॑ति (˚ते), pp. स्पृष्ट॑ (q.v.)<BR>touch (acc. or loc.) esp. अप॑स्, उदकम् etc. touch water, also<BR>अद्भिस् wash or sprinkle with water ((r.));<BR> feel, perceive (by touching);<BR>reach up to (loc. or acc.);<BR> attain, obtain, incur, suffer. C.<BR>स्पर्शय˚ते), pp. स्पृष्ट॑ (q.v.) touch (acc. or loc.) esp. अप॑स्,<BR>उदकम् etc. touch water, also अद्भिस् wash or sprinkle with water<BR>((r.));<BR> feel, perceive (by touching);<BR> reach up to (loc. or acc.);<BR> attain,<BR>obtain, incur, suffer. C. स्पर्शयति (˚ते) cause or make to touch (2<BR>acc.), bring into immediate contact with (loc. or instr.);<BR> present to,<BR>bestow on (dat.). — अधि touch (superficially). अनु touch, fill<BR>with (instr.). अभि touch, visit, afflict. आ touch slightly. उद्<BR>reach up to (acc.). उप touch, stroke, caress;<BR> w. अपस् etc. = S.<BR>(also ± instr. of the water & ± acc. of the touched parts of the body).<BR>समुप touch (esp. water or with water;<BR> cf. S.), bathe in (loc.).<BR>परि touch, stroke. सम् touch, bring in contact with (instr.);<BR> reach<BR>to, attain, visit, befall;<BR> ±अपस् etc. wash, bathe ((r.)). — Cf.<BR>उपस्पृष्ट, संस्पृष्ट.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=646" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पृश्
2 स्पृश् (nom. स्पृक्) & स्पृश a. touching, reaching (—˚).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=646" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

