स्म
स्म enclitic and slightly asseverative, often pleonastic, is<BR>added to other particles, esp. ह & हि, to न & मा, to rel, & dem.<BR>pronouns, & to verbs, esp. to the present tense, which it gives the<BR>value of a past.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=647" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मत्
