स्मि
स्मि स्म॑यते स्म॑य˚ति pp. स्मित (q.v.) smile, blush,<BR>be proud or arrogant. — अव blush down (of the dawn). उद् smile up<BR>(with pride). अभ्युद् & उप smile upon (acc.). प्र break out into a<BR>laugh. वि be astounded or surprised by (instr., loc., or abl.);<BR> be<BR>proud, boast of (intr.). — Cf. विस्मित.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=647" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

