स्मृ
स्मृ स्म॑रति स्म॑र˚ते pp. स्मृत (q.v.) remember (gen.<BR>or acc.);<BR> recollect, call to mind;<BR> hand down, record, declare, teach<BR>(esp. P. स्मर्यते be recorded or declared as a law or custom, pass for<BR>(nom. or loc.). Caus. स्मारयति & स्मरयति cause to remember, remind<BR>(2 acc. or gen. of pers. & acc. of th.). — अनु remember, collect;<BR>confess. C. remind. अप lose conscience, forget. उप remember, call<BR>to mind (acc.). प्र remember or forget. प्रति remember;<BR> C. remind.<BR>वि forget;<BR> C. cause to forget (2 acc.). सम् remember (acc.);<BR> C.<BR>remind of (2 acc.). — Cf. अनुस्मृत, विस्मृत, संस्मृत.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=647" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मृत|स्मृतः
स्मृत a. remembered, handed down by memory or tradition,<BR>taught, enjoined;<BR> passing for, named, called (nom. ±इति).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=647" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मृति|स्मृतिः
