स्यद्
1 स्यद् स्यन्द् स्य॑न्दते स्य॑न्द˚ति pp. स्यन्न॑ flow,<BR>run, drive (in a carriage), hasten. C. स्यन्दयति = S. — अच्छ flow<BR>or run to (acc.). अनु run towards or along. अभि the same, overflow.<BR>अव flow down. आ & उप run or flow towards (acc.). नि flow down.<BR>प्र flow, run;<BR> drive away (in a carriage). परि flow around. वि<BR>flow forth or over, flow abundantly. सम् flow or run together. — Cf.<BR>वि॑ष्यण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=648" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

