स्रंसिन्
स्रंसिन् a. getting loose, falling down, depending.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=648" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

