स्रु स्र॑वति (स्र॑व˚ते), pp. स्रुत flow, stream;<BR> flow<BR>with (instr. or acc.);<BR> drip, leak (vessel);<BR> flow or waste away, perish,<BR>be lost. C. स्रावयति & स्रवयति cause to flow, spill, shed. — अति<BR>flow over. अधि flow off (abl.). अभि flow hither. अव flow down;<BR>C. = अन्वव C. cause to flow down. आ & उप flow towards (acc.).<BR>नि flow down. निस् flow asunder or out, flow forth, rise from (abl).<BR>परि flow around or abundantly;<BR> run away, pass (time). प्र flow<BR>forth, stream from (abl.);<BR> let<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=649" target="_blank">Page649</a>]<BR>flow, discharge. अभिप्र &<BR>संप्र stream forth. वि stream forth, flow from (abl.);<BR> let flow,<BR>discharge;<BR> melt away, perish. सम् flow or run together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=648" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

