स्विद्
1 स्विद् स्वेदते स्विद्यति स्वेदते स्विद्य˚ते pp.<BR>स्विन्न॑ sweat, perspire. C. स्वेदयति cause to sweat, make warm,<BR>foment. — प्र begin to sweat, become moist. सम् C. = S.C.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=655" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्विद्
2 स्विद् (indecl.) lays stress upon an interr. pron. or makes it<BR>indefinite (कः॑ स्विद् who then or whosoever, क्व॑ स्विद् anywhere),<BR>often expletive. Follows अपि, उत (which it also precedes), & आहो.<BR>Often in disjunctive questions in both clauses, alone or with a pronoun<BR>or another particle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=655" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्विन्न|स्विन्नः
स्विन्न॑ a. perspired, sweated;<BR> seethed, boiled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=655" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्विषु
