स्विष्टकृत्
स्विष्टकृ॑त् a. offering good sacrifices, E. of Agni.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=655" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

