स्वीय|स्वीयः
स्वीय a. one's own.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=655" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

