स्वेदजल n. sweat;<BR> ˚कण m. & ˚कणिका f. drop of<BR>sweat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=655" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वेदन|स्वेदनं
