स्वैर|स्वैरः
स्वैर a. moving on gently or cautiously;<BR> n. adv. of one's<BR>own accord, spontaneously, freely, easily, carelessly (also ˚— &<BR>instr.);<BR> gently, slowly, cautiously;<BR> as subst. independence^1, free choice.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by AnnaRybakovaT, Jim Funderburk. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=655" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

