स्वैर˚वृत्त a. acting freely.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=656" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वैरिन्
स्वैरिन् a. free, independent;<BR> wanton, unchaste (woman).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=656" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

