हठ|हठः
हठ m. violence, force, obstinacy;<BR> ˚—, abl., & instr.<BR>adv. violently, forcibly, necessarily, absolutely, by all means.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=656" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हठकर्मन्
