हन्त|हंत
ह॑न्त interj. come! go to! well! often repeated or w. हा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=657" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हन्तव्य
हन्तव्य a. to be killed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=657" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

