हि
1 हि हिनो॑ति हिनुते हि॑न्वति (ह॑यति), pp. हित॑<BR>impel, urge on, set in motion, hurl, send forth (M. intr. hasten,<BR>speed);<BR> further, help to (dat.);<BR> get, procure. आ M. bring near. प्र<BR>(हिणोति) urge on, impel, hurl, cast, turn upon (dat. or loc.);<BR> call<BR>upon, summon;<BR> send out, dismiss, dispatch to (dat., gen. ±अन्तिकम् or<BR>पार्श्वम्, acc. ±प्रति), in order to (dat. or infin.);<BR> bring near,<BR>get, procure, furnish. अनुप्र send after. अभिप्र send hither.<BR>उपप्र send to (acc.). प्रतिप्र send or drive back. सम् send out;<BR>bring together, join, combine, compose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=662" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हि
2 हि॑ (indecl.) for, because, namely;<BR> surely, verily, indeed;<BR>well, pray (with an imper., conj., or optat.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=662" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

