ह्वृ
†ह्वृ ह्वरते (only —˚), pp. ह्वृत go crookedly, bend<BR>over, fall. C. ह्वारयति cause to go crookedly (fig.), lead astray;<BR> M.<BR>deviate, go astray. —आ lead astray or into trouble. उप go<BR>crookedly. वि stagger, fall;<BR> C. overturn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CAE&page=670" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=cae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

